    shu "“专修水管”的电话……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:213
translate chinese ep3part2_f31c9018:

    # shu "Who the fuck is this?!"
    shu "这他妈是谁啊？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:214
translate chinese ep3part2_d52c15a9:

    # mc "More importantly, why are you acting like my girlfriend?"
    mc "更重要的问题是，你干嘛跟我女朋友似的？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:215
translate chinese ep3part2_d79531ce:

    # mc "Anyway, it's Naomi. Pick it up."
    mc "那是娜奥米。接吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:219
translate chinese ep3part2_c8a4a84d:

    # shu "Alright. Go ahead."
    shu "好了。你说吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:220
translate chinese ep3part2_2070d8b3:

    # mc "Hey Naomi! Forget something?"
    mc "嗨，娜奥米！有什么事吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:221
translate chinese ep3part2_52e3c261:

    # n "Yeah, mate. Got sidetracked these past few weeks."
    n "你好，伙计。这几个星期一直没干什么正事。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:222
translate chinese ep3part2_60a43cc2:

    # mc "No worries. I've been swamped, too."
    mc "小问题，我也累得够呛。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:223
translate chinese ep3part2_945d3a5b:

    # mc "So what's up?"
    mc "所以，是什么情况？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:224
translate chinese ep3part2_cda71217:

    # n "Would it be too much trouble to ask you to come by now? I'm workin' on somethin' and could use some big hands."
    n "能麻烦你过来一趟吗？我这边干的活需要个力气大的人帮忙。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:225
translate chinese ep3part2_4da1efcd:

    # mc "Now you've piqued my curiosity..."
    mc "这下你可勾住我的好奇心了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:229
translate chinese ep3part2_d9c82e30:

    # mc "... But I can't. [landlady] just called me home for lunch."
    mc "……但是我去不了。我[landlady!t]刚打过电话，让我回家吃午饭。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:230
translate chinese ep3part2_b98c68ae:

    # n "No worries. I'll figure something out. Take care, mate."
    n "没关系。那我自己想想办法吧。再见，伙计。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:231
translate chinese ep3part2_0dfdcd09:

    # mc "You too."
    mc "嗯，再见。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:234
translate chinese ep3part2_b32f16c4:

    # yt "... I sensed a hint of frustration in that response."
    yt "……感觉她回答的语气里有些许失落。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:235
translate chinese ep3part2_3db60edf:

    # yt "She was looking forward to it, huh?"
    yt "她是在期待着我过去吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:239
translate chinese ep3part2_eb196f5d:

    # mc "... Yeah, why not! You've made me curious."
    mc "……好啊，没问题！我挺好奇的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:240
translate chinese ep3part2_121f30a7:

    # mc "I have some of the gang with me, though. I need to drop them off first."
    mc "不过我现在正跟朋友在一块。我得先把他们送回去。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:241
translate chinese ep3part2_bbed99f5:

    # n "Take your time, mate. I ain't goin' anywhere."
    n "慢慢来，伙计。我这边不急。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:242
translate chinese ep3part2_f5ee6bc6:

    # n "And hey, about that dinner... how about we make it lunch instead?"
    n "对了，之前答应过你的晚饭……换成午饭怎么样？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:243
translate chinese ep3part2_1da0f14d:

    # mc "Ohh, works for me!"
    mc "好啊，我没问题！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:244
translate chinese ep3part2_ab2581d3:

    # n "Cool. I'll be waitin'."
    n "好。我等着你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:248
translate chinese ep3part2_01993bab:

    # shu "Naomi, huh... She's always nice to me."
    shu "娜奥米啊……她对我一直很好。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:249
translate chinese ep3part2_44f4fc97:

    # f "She is to everybody. But sometimes, I can barely keep up with her when she talks."
    f "她对每个人都很好。不过有时候，她说起话来我根本跟不上她。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:250
translate chinese ep3part2_809e3b5a:

    # shu "Same here."
    shu "我也一样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:251
translate chinese ep3part2_abda4d0a:

    # mc "You'll get the hang of it. Just give it some time."
    mc "过段时间你们也就习惯了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:252
translate chinese ep3part2_9e9634d7:

    # shu "Is it just me, or does her voice kinda make you wanna relax and doze off? Ever notice that?"
    shu "只有我一个人觉得听了她的声音之后会很放松，想打瞌睡吗？你们有没有这种感觉？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:253
translate chinese ep3part2_485f5e09:

    # mc "*chuckles* It's not just you."
    mc "*笑* 真不是只有你一个。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:254
translate chinese ep3part2_44ac6493:

    # shu "She could make a killing recording audiobooks. Haha!"
    shu "她要是去给有声书录音绝对能赚大钱。哈哈！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:255
translate chinese ep3part2_d8701961:

    # mc "Pretty sure I said the exact same thing once."
    mc "我之前也说过一模一样的话。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:274
translate chinese ep3part2_8cc12b4e:

    # n "Nice truck, mate."
    n "车不错，伙计。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:275
translate chinese ep3part2_3b7b2a01:

    # mc "It's technically not mine, but I figured you might've scoped it out already."
    mc "严格来说，这车算不上我的。不过我想你之前已经看过这辆车了吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:276
translate chinese ep3part2_6696b232:

    # n "Not up close."
    n "没有站得这么近看过。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:279
translate chinese ep3part2_9a106743:

    # mc "... You've got less stuff in here than last time. What happened?"
    mc "……你这里的东西跟上次比少得多了啊。发生什么了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:282
translate chinese ep3part2_384f6d5a:

    # n "Ahh, that lot?"
    n "啊，那边那些啊？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:283
translate chinese ep3part2_7f6b5f67:

    # n "Few smaller industrial companies have been buyin' our junk. One recently did a bulk buy, and what ya see's what's left."
    n "有几个小公司一直在买我们这的垃圾。有一家最近刚买走一大批，那边都是买剩下的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:284
translate chinese ep3part2_d9a066dc:

    # n "To be real, they could've taken it all. Managin' this lot without the old man's been a bit of a slog."
    n "说实话，真想让他们把这些东西全都拉走。老头不在，招呼这么多玩意儿可不好受。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:287
translate chinese ep3part2_36179020:

    # mc "Missing him already?"
    mc "已经开始想他了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:288
translate chinese ep3part2_94814ddb:

    # n "*chuckles* No way. I've got a lot more freedom without him hoverin' about. He can stay out in the countryside for all I care."
    n "*笑* 想什么想。没他天天指手画脚的，我自由多了。他就一直在乡下待着吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:289
translate chinese ep3part2_6760e59c:

    # n "And I reckon Mum won't let him pop back too quickly either. He was havin' a ripper of a time just stickin' 'round the capital."
    n "而且老妈应该也不会让他很快就回来。他在乡下玩得老开心了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:292
translate chinese ep3part2_3f9ad59b:

    # mc "Yeah, I recall you folks run a coffee farm, too."
    mc "是啊，我记得你们家还有个咖啡农场吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:293
translate chinese ep3part2_fe1929f4:

    # mc "Hope your Mum doesn't give him too hard a time."
    mc "希望你妈妈别让他累着呢。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:296
translate chinese ep3part2_76f212b3:

    # n "It'd do him good, in my book."
    n "我倒觉得对他有好处。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:297
translate chinese ep3part2_3ca11b09:

    # n "No pain, no gain, right?"
    n "没有付出，哪来的收获嘛。对不对？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:298
translate chinese ep3part2_29e0bd0d:

    # mc "Wouldn't be my choice with a bunch of broken bones, that's for sure..."
    mc "反正我要是一把老骨头了，可不想再受折腾……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:301
translate chinese ep3part2_08b4e881:

    # n "Over here, mate. I'll show ya."
    n "过来，伙计。我让你看看。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:302
translate chinese ep3part2_ff3f8d60:

    # mc "Ah, the thing you've been on about."
    mc "啊，你之前说的那个东西是吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:303
translate chinese ep3part2_1f06b95f:

    # yt "God, her skin under sunlight is just glistening white."
    yt "天啊，她的皮肤在阳光下真是白得刺眼。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:306
translate chinese ep3part2_a0a82e40:

    # n "Wanna have a stab at what it is?"
    n "要不猜猜是什么？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:307
translate chinese ep3part2_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:308
translate chinese ep3part2_40e7966c:

    # mc "You're not very good at surprises, are you?"
    mc "你不太擅长给人惊喜啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:309
translate chinese ep3part2_b9e0a59d:

    # mc "What could be in there aside from some kind of vehicle?"
    mc "里面除了是车，还能是什么？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:312
translate chinese ep3part2_5a610ad7:

    # n "{cps=25}Oi, don't be so quick to judge, mate! What if I've been workin' on a bloody smart AI robot, eh? Not some bloody tin can, but somethin' with a bit o' wit!"
    n "{cps=25}哎，别急着把话说死嘛，伙计！万一我一直在弄什么AI机器人咧？不是什么傻铁块子喔，是有脑子滴！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:320
translate chinese ep3part2_ab1a6dee:

    # mc "A robot... huh?"
    mc "机器人……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:321
translate chinese ep3part2_b08acc19:

    # n "Righto! But not just any ol' robot."
    n "对咯！可不是什么简单的机器人咯。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:322
translate chinese ep3part2_2b5ead65:

    # n "Imagine an AI so bloody advanced it learns and adapts, and reckon, one day, could have the whole world under its shiny metal boot."
    n "这个AI厉害得很喏，会学习，会进化，说不定将来要把全世界踩在脚底下咧！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:323
translate chinese ep3part2_355f935b:

    # n "Me own little creation could be the brains of the future - or the boss of us all!"
    n "我造的小玩意儿要统治世界咯！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:324
translate chinese ep3part2_33a415b8:

    # mc "Sounds like a sci-fi movie ready to roll. Just promise me it'll remember us little guys in a good light?"
    mc "完全是科幻电影里的剧情啊。那它能给我们几个留条活路吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:325
translate chinese ep3part2_6d9b4030:

    # n "Can't make any promises, mate, but I'll slip in a good word for ya!"
    n "没法跟你保证，伙计，不过我能替你说几句好话！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:326
translate chinese ep3part2_4a4eb8ed:

    # mc "You're a real comfort, y'know that?"
    mc "哈哈，真是多谢你了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:327
translate chinese ep3part2_4dd707de:

    # mc "And there goes your accent slipping out of nowhere again..."
    mc "你说话又突然开始带口音了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:328
translate chinese ep3part2_9a66db44:

    # mc "You're excited, aren't you?"
    mc "你是兴奋起来了吧？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:331
translate chinese ep3part2_37fb19a8:

    # n "*chuckles* Not really. Maybe. It's classified."
    n "*笑* 算不上。可能吧。这是秘密。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:334
translate chinese ep3part2_5d16f655:

    # n "Anyway, here she is."
    n "总之，这就是那台小宝贝了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:335
translate chinese ep3part2_3d3d704a:

    # mc "She...?"
    mc "小宝贝……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:340
translate chinese ep3part2_2650010a:

    # mc "Dodge Challenger SRT, huh? Now that's what I like to see!"
    mc "道奇挑战者SRT？够带劲的啊！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:341
translate chinese ep3part2_9a63b03b:

    # n "It is a Dodge Challenger SRT, but may I ask if ya know what model?"
    n "确实是道奇挑战者SRT，但是你知道具体是什么型号吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:344
translate chinese ep3part2_cdedfba8:

    # mc "Of course! That'd be the 392!"
    mc "当然知道！是392！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:345
translate chinese ep3part2_26bdb669:

    # n "Sorry, mate. It's the Demon."
    n "错咯，伙计。是恶魔。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:346
translate chinese ep3part2_10c4e66e:

    # n "The 2018 Demon, to be precise."
    n "再详细点说，是2018款的恶魔。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:349
translate chinese ep3part2_7592acfa:

    # mc "That'd be none other than the Demon. Quite a beast from what I've heard."
    mc "当然是恶魔了。我听说这辆车可是头不折不扣的怪物。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:352
translate chinese ep3part2_7673dc52:

    # n "Spot on, mate! You've got a keen eye."
    n "一点没错，伙计！你眼很尖啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:353
translate chinese ep3part2_8fd3be2b:

    # n "It's the 2018 Demon, to be more precise."
    n "再详细点说，是2018款的恶魔。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:356
translate chinese ep3part2_b11af97c:

    # mc "Of course! That'd be the Hellcat!"
    mc "当然知道！是地狱猫！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:357
translate chinese ep3part2_26bdb669_1:

    # n "Sorry, mate. It's the Demon."
    n "错咯，伙计。是恶魔。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:358
translate chinese ep3part2_10c4e66e_1:

    # n "The 2018 Demon, to be precise."
    n "再详细点说，是2018款的恶魔。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:362
translate chinese ep3part2_26afcbe5:

    # n "She's one helluva machine."
    n "这车可不简单。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:363
translate chinese ep3part2_01840a1d:

    # n "Packed with a supercharged 6.2-liter V8, she belts out a whopping 840 horses with the right fuel, and she'll catapult ya from nought to 60 in a mere 2.3 seconds."
    n "里面装了6.2升的增压V8发动机，只要加对燃料，就能爆发出840匹的马力来。而且，从0加速到60英里，只要短短2.3秒。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:364
translate chinese ep3part2_f9eaf54b:

    # n "Ain't she a beauty? More than just a car, she's a ferocious beast on wheels."
    n "多漂亮的美人啊。这都不算车了，是装了轮子的残暴野兽。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:365
translate chinese ep3part2_3cef4f73:

    # mc "I'd say that's quite impressive, but \"beauty\" isn't the right word to describe it at the moment."
    mc "确实挺厉害的，但这车现在的状态，用“漂亮”形容不太合适吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:366
translate chinese ep3part2_85762249:

    # mc "More like... rusty."
    mc "应该用……“生锈”。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:367
translate chinese ep3part2_ec68d207:

    # yt "... I could probably rev things up a few horsepower."
    yt "……说不定我能再加大点马力。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:372
translate chinese ep3part2_0e89a4b7:

    # mc "I must admit, it looks a bit weathered. But... there's an undeniable charm seeing you there in the driver's seat."
    mc "不得不承认，它经历过一些风霜。但是……看到你坐在驾驶座上，就有一种无法抗拒的魅力。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:375
translate chinese ep3part2_75f65251:

    # n "Aw, ya reckon? Tryin' to sweet-talk me won't save this ol' girl from a good polish, mate."
    n "啊，是吗？再怎么夸我，这辆小美女也逃不过一场大修，伙计。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:376
translate chinese ep3part2_2fde761d:

    # mc "I wasn't planning on it. But you must admit, a beautiful driver can make any car shine, rust and all."
    mc "我不是那个意思。但你也必须承认吧，只要有漂亮的司机，再破再锈的车也能发光。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:377
translate chinese ep3part2_d5a7f25c:

    # n "You're a smooth talker, ain't ya?"
    n "你嘴挺甜啊？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:378
translate chinese ep3part2_86761db0:

    # n "I've clocked it, y'know, all the sheilas hangin' 'round ya."
    n "我都懂的，知道吧，一大群姑娘都围着你转。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:379
translate chinese ep3part2_bd8b3e81:

    # n "But like I said, mate, I just-"
    n "但我也说过，伙计，我——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:382
translate chinese ep3part2_e7b105dc:

    # mc "I get it. You're not looking for anything serious. And I respect that, really."
    mc "我懂的。你不想来真的。我尊重你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:383
translate chinese ep3part2_360771b2:

    # mc "But is it wrong for a guy to compliment a pretty lady without any ulterior motives?"
    mc "但是男人毫无别的目的，仅仅只是夸奖一下漂亮女人，也有错吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:386
translate chinese ep3part2_28aa39a7:

    # n "*chuckles* No, it's not, and that's a bit of a relief, honestly."
    n "*笑* 没有错，说实话，我反而放心了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:387
translate chinese ep3part2_9af0ceeb:

    # n "I don't want to hurt ya, mate. Especially not a top bloke like ya."
    n "我不想伤害你，伙计。特别是你这样的好男人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:388
translate chinese ep3part2_054c5ee0:

    # mc "I see."
    mc "我明白。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:389
translate chinese ep3part2_91054ca0:

    # yt "She doesn't want to hurt me, huh... I wonder why..."
    yt "她不想伤害我啊……为什么呢……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:391
translate chinese ep3part2_71d92279:

    # yt "I can tell there's more than just mechanical passion in her eyes when she talks about this machine..."
    yt "她在说这辆车的时候，眼睛里绝对不是只有对机械的热爱……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:392
translate chinese ep3part2_7665733f:

    # yt "She made it clear she's not into commitments, and throwing compliments around might just muddle things between us."
    yt "她清楚地说过不想谈恋爱，随便夸她可能只会让我们的关系变得不清不楚。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:393
translate chinese ep3part2_9ca205bf:

    # yt "I value our friendship too much to risk it over a misinterpreted compliment."
    yt "为了不伤害我们的友谊，还是谨言慎行为好。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:397
translate chinese ep3part2_0cacfe19:

    # mc "Well... she sure could use a bit of TLC!"
    mc "嗯……这车是需要好好细心呵护一下了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:401
translate chinese ep3part2_074c70ed:

    # n "The paint job can wait. We've got a bigger snag than that."
    n "涂装可以等等再说。我们有更大的麻烦。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:402
translate chinese ep3part2_04227959:

    # mc "She can't run?"
    mc "她跑不起来吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:405
translate chinese ep3part2_beb68fbb:

    # n "What's it look like to ya?"
    n "你觉得呢？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:406
translate chinese ep3part2_d92e48ee:

    # mc "She's a no-go, then..."
    mc "我看也是……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:418
translate chinese ep3part2_84b0cc88:

    # n "Aside from that, she's missin' a couple of key components here."
    n "除此之外，她还缺了很多关键的部分。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:419
translate chinese ep3part2_46f5f462:

    # n "First off, the glass - she's got no side windows or windshield. Crucial, not just for aerodynamics but safety as well."
    n "首先，是玻璃——没有侧窗，也没有挡风玻璃。这问题很严重，不仅影响阻力，也不安全。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:420
translate chinese ep3part2_a2297202:

    # n "The headlights and taillights are gone, which not only makes her unroadworthy, but also bloody unsafe."
    n "头灯跟尾灯也没有了，更是非常不安全，没法开上路。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:421
translate chinese ep3part2_6a480df3:

    # n "Can't have her blind and invisible on the roads."
    n "没有了车灯，在路上既看不见别人，也没法被别人看见。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:422
translate chinese ep3part2_e4b8ee80:

    # mc "That's a fair point. These are essential parts we're talking about."
    mc "说得对，这些都是很重要的部分。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:425
translate chinese ep3part2_c2ff853f:

    # n "Exactly, and don't get me started on the trunk cover. That's just leavin' the rear exposed."
    n "没错，更别提后备箱的盖子了。让后面整个都露出来了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:426
translate chinese ep3part2_f4993063:

    # n "Plus, it messes with the overall aesthetic and function, doesn't it?"
    n "而且，对车整体的美观和功能也有影响，对不对？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:429
translate chinese ep3part2_cd4d2072:

    # mc "Absolutely, and I guess the interior needs quite a bit of attention too?"
    mc "那当然。我觉得内饰也需要操操心？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:430
translate chinese ep3part2_62bb2897:

    # n "You hit the nail on the head."
    n "说到点子上了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:431
translate chinese ep3part2_c2353635:

    # n "The interior is lackin' in a few spots as well - missing a bit of the dashboard, seat belts are shot, and the seats themselves have seen better days."
    n "内饰也有不少问题——仪表盘坏了好几个地方，安全带也不行了，再加上座椅的情况也不好。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:432
translate chinese ep3part2_c84b3133:

    # n "It's not just makin' her look pretty; it's preservin' and enhancing what's under the hood by making sure every other component is up to snuff."
    n "可不仅仅是要让她变好看而已；得对每个部分都细细把关，让她能发挥到最好。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:433
translate chinese ep3part2_fa893981:

    # mc "Totally get it. A car like this deserves to be restored to its former glory, with each part playing its role."
    mc "我完全理解。这种车值得让她恢复往日荣光。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:434
translate chinese ep3part2_94bca9a5:

    # mc "Although... It's going to be quite the project. Nevertheless, you know your stuff."
    mc "不过……肯定要花不少功夫。但是，你的本领也不是盖的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:437
translate chinese ep3part2_143a7ffa:

    # mc "... Wait, we're here talking about it like this car's a normal thing for people to have."
    mc "……等一下，我们在这聊了半天，好像这车是随便谁都能搞来的一样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:438
translate chinese ep3part2_2c208199:

    # mc "Where did you get her in the first place?"
    mc "你从哪弄来的？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:441
translate chinese ep3part2_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:444
translate chinese ep3part2_e78b73a4:

    # n "That's... a story for another time, mate."
    n "这个……就留到下次再说吧，伙计。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:445
translate chinese ep3part2_f38d38b5:

    # mc "... A-alright."
    mc "……好-好吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:448
translate chinese ep3part2_12406b6e:

    # yt "Why did she suddenly pause like that? It's like I hit on something..."
    yt "她怎么突然这样？我好像碰到她的敏感区了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:453
translate chinese ep3part2_25e9a465:

    # n "Anyway, here's our problem."
    n "总之，问题在这里。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:454
translate chinese ep3part2_f96a8da3:

    # mc "The engine? It looks alright to me! Heck, it even looks brand new!"
    mc "发动机吗？我看着感觉没问题啊！跟全新的一样！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:455
translate chinese ep3part2_242fd9c8:

    # n "That's because it already had some of yer so-called TLC."
    n "那是因为我已经“细心呵护”过了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:458
translate chinese ep3part2_a402726d:

    # n "I tried to start her a few days ago, but I noticed an unusual vibration and an odd, rhythmic tickin' noise."
    n "我几天前试着发动过一次，发现有种不正常的振动，还有很奇怪的一种有节奏的滴答声。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:459
translate chinese ep3part2_051c1a75:

    # mc "And... that means?"
    mc "呃……什么意思？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:462
translate chinese ep3part2_54943e03:

    # n "There's an issue with the crankshaft."
    n "是曲轴出了毛病。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:463
translate chinese ep3part2_f9ce3693:

    # n "Crankshafts are crucial for convertin' the pistons' up-and-down movement into rotational motion to drive the vehicle."
    n "曲轴是用来把活塞的上下运动转化成转动的零件，没了它汽车就动不起来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:464
translate chinese ep3part2_74fcf35a:

    # n "There might be some kind of damage to it causin' the unusual noise."
    n "可能是曲轴受损了，所以才有奇怪的声音。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:465
translate chinese ep3part2_250a3928:

    # mc "Oh, I see... I think? At least I'm learning from you."
    mc "啊，我懂了……应该……懂了？至少从你这学到了点东西。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:466
translate chinese ep3part2_bab93989:

    # mc "So what do we do with it?"
    mc "那我们该怎么办呢？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:469
translate chinese ep3part2_b808b25c:

    # n "I'm afraid we'll have to do a full engine pull. That's where your muscles will come into play."
    n "恐怕得把发动机给完全搬出来了。所以才需要你的肌肉。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:470
translate chinese ep3part2_5ce59d5d:

    # mc "Now it all makes sense."
    mc "原来是这样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:479
translate chinese ep3part2_3a31b592:

    # n "No matter how small the damage is, it could spell disaster on the track."
    n "不管是多小的损伤，都可能在路上引发大问题。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:480
translate chinese ep3part2_8a20e596:

    # n "Besides the crankshaft issue, the crankcase, bearings, and possibly the connecting rods could be at risk or compromised."
    n "除了曲轴之外，曲轴箱，轴承，可能还有连杆，说不定也会有毛病。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:481
translate chinese ep3part2_0e2ef201:

    # n "The whole engine needs to be taken out to conduct a thorough inspection and ensure that no collateral damage has affected other components."
    n "需要把发动机整个拆开，彻底检查一遍，确保其他零件没有受到连带损伤。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:482
translate chinese ep3part2_79860f6a:

    # mc "Let's say the crankshaft is damaged: then you'll have to replace it."
    mc "就假设曲轴受损了吧，那就必须换一个。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:483
translate chinese ep3part2_8a21c608:

    # mc "It'll be damn expensive considering this beast's manufacturer."
    mc "考虑到这台猛兽的制造商，肯定会贵得吓人吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:484
translate chinese ep3part2_2c918c04:

    # n "No worries, already have the replacement. I went with the aftermarket option, so it was less expensive."
    n "没关系，我已经有替换件了。不是原厂原装的零件，所以没那么贵。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:485
translate chinese ep3part2_c000ab13:

    # mc "Seriously?! You don't even know if it's actually a crankshaft issue!"
    mc "真的啊？！可你都还不知道是不是真的是曲轴的问题呢！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:486
translate chinese ep3part2_f740eef3:

    # n "With my years of experience in this line of work, I'm certain it is."
    n "我在这一行干这么多年了，非常确定。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:487
translate chinese ep3part2_2a4484e5:

    # n "Sometimes, I don't have to look at the issue to diagnose it."
    n "有时候不用看就能找到毛病。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:488
translate chinese ep3part2_d9d300ad:

    # mc "Damn..."
    mc "我去……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:489
translate chinese ep3part2_53c3ec13:

    # mc "Oh, that's right... How long have you been doing this?"
    mc "哦，对了……你在这一行干了多久了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:490
translate chinese ep3part2_7b8a9d47:

    # n "With automobiles specifically..."
    n "只论汽车的话……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:491
translate chinese ep3part2_894c0db5:

    # n "... From when I was seven."
    n "……从我七岁的时候开始的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:492
translate chinese ep3part2_9b3b4d46:

    # mc "That young?!"
    mc "那么早啊？！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:493
translate chinese ep3part2_90369dcf:

    # n "Yeah..."
    n "是啊……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:494
translate chinese ep3part2_369804b2:

    # n "In any case, let's get her done, eh?"
    n "总之，我们赶快开始吧？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:495
translate chinese ep3part2_39fd152b:

    # mc "Sure! Leave the heavy lifting to me."
    mc "好！把重活留给我就行。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:501
translate chinese ep3part2_0cf7c79e:

    # "A few hours later..."
    "几个小时之后……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:509
translate chinese ep3part2_1f56feb7:

    # mc "Ready?"
    mc "准备好了没？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:510
translate chinese ep3part2_113bcee3:

    # n "Yeah, give it a go, mate!"
    n "嗯，打火吧，伙计！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:517
translate chinese ep3part2_92c4ce53:

    # mc "Ass kickin'!"
    mc "牛逼啊！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:518
translate chinese ep3part2_5c0776bc:

    # mc "Man, listen to her purr!"
    mc "听听这声音！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:521
translate chinese ep3part2_3ef65d93:

    # n "Hey, Na-"
    mc "哎，娜——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:524
translate chinese ep3part2_bb2cf764_1:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:525
translate chinese ep3part2_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:526
translate chinese ep3part2_4d9be501:

    # yt "Is that relief I'm seeing on her face...?"
    yt "她的表情……是有种解脱了的感觉吗……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:529
translate chinese ep3part2_c700eeb4:

    # n "Finally, after all these bloody months..."
    n "过了这么几个月，终于……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:530
translate chinese ep3part2_3e783533:

    # mc "You've been tinkering with her for months?"
    mc "你已经鼓捣了几个月了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:531
translate chinese ep3part2_41291aeb:

    # n "Yeah. It's not all been smooth sailin', y'know."
    n "是啊。遇上过不少难题呢。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:532
translate chinese ep3part2_e46781ac:

    # n "That crankshaft was a real pain in the arse to get situated and... despite lookin' good now, there's still a laundry list to get through."
    n "光是曲轴的事就够头疼的了，然后……别看现在似乎是没啥问题了，之后其实还有一大堆事要做。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:533
translate chinese ep3part2_4cc4117d:

    # mc "You're not just tweaking the engine then?"
    mc "所以你不是只在忙发动机的事了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:536
translate chinese ep3part2_c1d02737:

    # n "Oh, mate... it's never just the engine."
    n "伙计……从来都不会只用管发动机的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:537
translate chinese ep3part2_44cd76a8:

    # n "I've gotta look at a new paint job, and then there's the interior to think about, gauges to fix, and just a bunch of little bits and bobs to get her roadworthy."
    n "我得研究新涂装，然后还有内饰要考虑，要修仪表盘，其他杂七杂八的，都弄好了才能上路。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:538
translate chinese ep3part2_3fdc4d2e:

    # n "And the stuff I mentioned earlier as well."
    n "还有我刚刚提到的那些问题。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:541
translate chinese ep3part2_0e87e125:

    # n "But listen to her... she's well on her way, ain't she?"
    n "但是你听听……她已经恢复不少了，对不对？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:542
translate chinese ep3part2_5280f094:

    # mc "She is!"
    mc "那当然！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:543
translate chinese ep3part2_ea4179d2:

    # n "And thanks for lending a hand, mate. Means a lot to me."
    n "还有，谢谢你帮忙，伙计。我很感激。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:546
translate chinese ep3part2_1a4ca0a6:

    # mc "No biggie! The complicated stuff was all you. I didn't do much."
    mc "没什么的！复杂的活都是你干的。我没做多少。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:547
translate chinese ep3part2_a64870be:

    # n "Even so, your help sped things up. Every bit counts, y'know."
    n "尽管如此，你也做了贡献。哪怕一点点也是要算数的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:548
translate chinese ep3part2_db273193:

    # mc "Haha, okay, okay, I'll take the credit then."
    mc "哈哈，好吧，好吧，那我就接受了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:557
translate chinese ep3part2_711f1704:

    # n "So then..."
    n "那么……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:558
translate chinese ep3part2_e4e3b164:

    # n "You get to pop one question my way."
    n "你可以问我一个问题。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:559
translate chinese ep3part2_51d4ee8d:

    # mc "Sorry?"
    mc "什么？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:560
translate chinese ep3part2_cad3c17c:

    # n "I didn't just invite you here without a bit of give-and-take, mate. I don't roll like that."
    n "我不是让你来打白工的，伙计。我做不出那样的事。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:561
translate chinese ep3part2_e885af2c:

    # n "Ask away, I'll be straight up with my answer."
    n "随便问吧，我会如实回答。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:562
translate chinese ep3part2_699b74e7:

    # yt "Damn... What should I dive into?"
    yt "我去……这我该问什么啊？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:563
translate chinese ep3part2_48eb8457:

    # yt "There are stuff I wanna know about her, but... something's been gnawing at me since she mentioned it."
    yt "我有不少事想了解，但是……有件事自从她说起以来，我就一直很在意。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:564
translate chinese ep3part2_4df44042:

    # mc "... Alright, I got one."
    mc "……好，我想到一个问题。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:565
translate chinese ep3part2_af7d0743:

    # n "Shoot."
    n "问吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:566
translate chinese ep3part2_06fc3673:

    # mc "I know it's not your favorite topic, but you gave me a shot, so I gotta take it."
    mc "我知道你可能不太喜欢这个话题，但你给了我机会，我就得把握住。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:567
translate chinese ep3part2_f69612f8:

    # mc "I've gotta know, Naomi..."
    mc "我很想知道，娜奥米……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:568
translate chinese ep3part2_338cb092:

    # mc "Why are commitments not your thing?"
    mc "为什么你不愿意谈恋爱？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:571
translate chinese ep3part2_5868ae9b:

    # n "Oh..."
    n "啊……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:572
translate chinese ep3part2_93959ddf:

    # mc "Regretting that offer now?"
    mc "后悔让我问了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:575
translate chinese ep3part2_3fb23528:

    # n "No, I just didn't think you'd go poking around about me."
    n "不，我只是没想到你会问我的私事。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:576
translate chinese ep3part2_f460bb15:

    # mc "I mean, you can't blame me."
    mc "这也不能怪我嘛。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:577
translate chinese ep3part2_b739aba2:

    # mc "You gave me the choice, and I chose to ask something that matters."
    mc "你给了我选择，而我选了问有分量的问题。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:578
translate chinese ep3part2_79d4a2de:

    # n "*chuckles* Fair enough, mate..."
    n "*笑* 说得也是，伙计……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:579
translate chinese ep3part2_f6e909f0:

    # n "Well, let's make it short. I hate tellin' life stories for hours."
    n "好吧，那就长话短说。我不喜欢谈感情谈半天。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:584
translate chinese ep3part2_bb2cf764_2:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:587
translate chinese ep3part2_e44ffa35:

    # n "Truth be told, mate... you ain't the first to pry into my reluctance towards commitments."
    n "说实话，伙计……你不是第一个问这个问题的人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:588
translate chinese ep3part2_836d8eca:

    # n "... Normally, when folks ask, I'd just shield myself behind the typical notion that blokes are all the same when dealin' with sheilas."
    n "……平常别人问起来的时候，我都会用“是因为天底下的男人对女人都一个样”这种话搪塞过去。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:589
translate chinese ep3part2_0515b091:

    # n "But, my reality... it's a bit of a different story."
    n "但实际上……不是那样的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:592
translate chinese ep3part2_cd5418b6:

    # n "Before Francis, there were a few others."
    n "在弗朗西斯之前，我还有别的几个前任。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:593
translate chinese ep3part2_e5deecfe:

    # n "One was an artist, gentle soul. Loved me in a way that always made me feel like I was some kind of masterpiece he was always in awe of."
    n "其中一位是个艺术家，人很好。他爱我的方式，让我觉得我就好像他毕生追求的杰作一样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:594
translate chinese ep3part2_40ca7bb0:

    # n "Another was a mechanic like me. Shared the same passions and had loads in common, but somehow, like I always do, I still found a reason to walk away."
    n "另一个跟我一样，是个技工。我们有一样的热爱，一样的追求，但我还是一如既往，找了个理由分手了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:595
translate chinese ep3part2_bb458211:

    # n "Each relationship echoed the last - I'd find myself pullin' away, always endin' things because I thought they were just too bloody good for someone like me."
    n "每段感情都跟前一段一样——我总是先放手，总是觉得他们人太好了，我这种人实在配不上他们。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:597
translate chinese ep3part2_2d44db95:

    # mc "... Naomi, you're not..."
    mc "……娜奥米，你才不是……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:598
translate chinese ep3part2_e8661893:

    # n "Let me finish, mate..."
    n "听我说完，伙计……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:599
translate chinese ep3part2_4bbe5891:

    # mc "Sorry..."
    mc "抱歉……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:608
translate chinese ep3part2_e9c73bf3:

    # n "Then came Francis... He was different."
    n "然后就是弗朗西斯……他不一样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:609
translate chinese ep3part2_6f25a48a:

    # n "Something about him drew me in like no one else had. I thought that was love."
    n "他身上有些东西是绝无仅有的，深深吸引了我。我以为那就是爱。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:610
translate chinese ep3part2_0ed2fe7d:

    # n "It all fell apart when I saw what he was really like, so I ended it without a second thought."
    n "但在我发现他的真面目之后，那种吸引力也就完全消失了，所以我立马跟他断了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:611
translate chinese ep3part2_31bd7a7d:

    # n "But the pain lingered; a few weeks of being in a relationship cut deeper than I ever imagined."
    n "但是痛苦却没有消失；短短几个星期的恋爱，带来的伤害却远超我的想象。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:612
translate chinese ep3part2_6599646e:

    # n "Yeah, you could say I was an easy girl."
    n "可以说我就是那种easy girl吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:613
translate chinese ep3part2_3a7b147d:

    # mc "Naomi... I'm so sorry."
    mc "娜奥米……听到这些我真的很遗憾。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:614
translate chinese ep3part2_680bdec5:

    # n "Don't be, 'cause it's all on me."
    n "不用的，都是怪我。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:615
translate chinese ep3part2_3b6a0b94:

    # n "Y'see, before Francis, there was this someone who was genuinely good to me."
    n "在弗朗西斯之前，有个人对我真的很好。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:616
translate chinese ep3part2_9570d5b2:

    # n "Someone I left in the shadows of my selfish pursuits."
    n "我为了我自己自私的追求，离开了他。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:617
translate chinese ep3part2_5bbe4001:

    # n "The thought that keeps me up at night is \"what if\"..."
    n "在夜里，我满脑子想着“假如”，睡不着觉……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:618
translate chinese ep3part2_dad2da26:

    # n "What if I had given a real chance to those that came before?"
    n "假如我给了之前那些人机会，会怎么样？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:619
translate chinese ep3part2_c66d544c:

    # n "What if I hadn't been so quick to find flaws and end things?"
    n "假如我没有那么着急地挑毛病，闹分手，会怎么样？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:620
translate chinese ep3part2_18402cf3:

    # n "Would any of this mess have happened?"
    n "那样的话，这些烂摊子还会出现吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:621
translate chinese ep3part2_9acbef6f:

    # n "It's those thoughts, those what-ifs, that hold me back now."
    n "就是那些想法，那些假如，让我现在不敢迈出那一步。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:622
translate chinese ep3part2_0ea596de:

    # n "Sure, I learned me lesson at the end of it, but now there's this fear... a fear of causin' someone pain, y'know?"
    n "当然，我在最后也学到了教训，可是现在却又害怕……害怕会让别人难受。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:623
translate chinese ep3part2_ef330fa1:

    # n "Because I never learned a goddamn thing; I'm just a sad song with nothin' t'say."
    n "因为我怎么也没有长进；我就是个无可救药的人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:626
translate chinese ep3part2_91192c48:

    # n "... Since ya seem so keen on me..."
    n "……既然你对我这么上心……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:627
translate chinese ep3part2_9eb98448:

    # n "I've got a curveball for ya..."
    n "那我有个问题要问你……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:628
translate chinese ep3part2_b457ccf5:

    # mc "Hit me with it."
    mc "尽管问吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:629
translate chinese ep3part2_1310b018:

    # n "Close yer eyes, mate, and keep 'em shut."
    n "把眼睛闭上，伙计，闭紧了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:630
translate chinese ep3part2_38b2c1f1:

    # n "Try to forget my face, just for a sec."
    n "试着把我的脸忘掉。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:633
translate chinese ep3part2_355ab1bb:

    # mc "Uhm, sure..."
    mc "呃，好的……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:636
translate chinese ep3part2_a10591ad:

    # n "Now, without takin' a look at me, do ya think you could ever find it in yourself to love a screw-up like me?"
    n "好了，在不看我的情况下，你觉得你能爱上像我这样的烂人吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:644
translate chinese ep3part2_2f457c58:

    # mc "Looking into myself right now, with my eyes sealed shut, I'm faced with a pitch-black darkness..."
    mc "我现在紧闭双眼，眼前一片漆黑……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:645
translate chinese ep3part2_a69e7fb1:

    # mc "... Yet there's this vivid image of you, radiant and unbearably real."
    mc "……可是我依然能清楚地看到你，一样的漂亮、真实。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:646
translate chinese ep3part2_240d0d94:

    # mc "My heart doesn't need eyes to see your worth or the beauty you hold, Naomi."
    mc "我的心不需要眼睛也能明白你的价值和你的美，娜奥米。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:647
translate chinese ep3part2_f3a9a810:

    # mc "Yes, you've got a jagged and worn past, but don't we all?"
    mc "的确，你的过去不堪回首，但我们每个人不都一样吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:648
translate chinese ep3part2_890b471f:

    # mc "I'd be downright privileged to love a woman who's lived, learned, and still managed to hold onto a softness that life often tries to steal."
    mc "你经历过难关，学到了教训，还依然保留着一颗柔软的心，能爱上这样的女人是我的荣幸。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:649
translate chinese ep3part2_d000de37:

    # mc "So, even blinded like this, my answer is a heartfelt yes. I could find it within myself to love a woman like you."
    mc "所以，哪怕这样闭上眼睛，我心底的答案也是可以。我可以爱上你这样的女人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:656
translate chinese ep3part2_27b4862f:

    # yt "What's happening here? Is she just gazing at me?"
    yt "怎么回事？她是一直在盯着我看吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:659
translate chinese ep3part2_f45be926:

    # n "You can open 'em, [mc]..."
    n "可以睁眼了，[mc!t]……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:662
translate chinese ep3part2_48c9e46b:

    # yt "Hold on a second... When was the last time she actually called me by my name?"
    yt "等一下……她上次直接叫我的名字是什么时候的事了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:663
translate chinese ep3part2_f5a5d023:

    # yt "Hearing my name gently leave her lips after all this time..."
    yt "过了这么久，听到我的名字从她口中说出……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:664
translate chinese ep3part2_c89121ca:

    # yt "That feels... so genuine when she says it under her breath like that!"
    yt "感觉……无比的真诚！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:665
translate chinese ep3part2_5a08bf92:

    # yt "You can't help but get goosebumps and butterflies..."
    yt "让我浑身止不住地躁动起来……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:666
translate chinese ep3part2_d1097522:

    # yt "I swear, this woman is a different kind of drug!"
    yt "这个女人身上绝对有非同一般的魔力！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:669
translate chinese ep3part2_050afd54:

    # n "[mc]... folks don't really converse like that anymore, y'know?"
    n "[mc!t]……现在的男人可不会像你那样说话了，知道吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:670
translate chinese ep3part2_c1726b10:

    # mc "I know. But I bet many wish they dared to speak like that to a lady like you."
    mc "我知道。但是他们要是遇见你这样的姑娘，肯定也会口若悬河的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:676
translate chinese ep3part2_888759cd:

    # n "Ain't you a charmer."
    n "你可真是个小可爱。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:677
translate chinese ep3part2_42bd829d:

    # mc "Wait, what?"
    mc "啊，什么？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:678
translate chinese ep3part2_ada7816d:

    # n "Let's shake a leg, yeah? We need to get cleaned up. We've got some lunch to catch up on."
    n "我们走吧？得把身上洗干净。之后还要吃午饭。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:683
translate chinese ep3part2_0e230916:

    # mc "I can't lie to you, Naomi. It's a tough question to answer honestly without more time to really understand each other."
    mc "我没法对你撒谎，娜奥米。这个问题很难回答，我们还需要更多时间互相了解才行。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:684
translate chinese ep3part2_a695decb:

    # mc "It's difficult to say I could love someone without knowing them through and through."
    mc "如果对对方没有彻底的了解的话，我很难说出我会爱上一个人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:685
translate chinese ep3part2_238e2628:

    # mc "Love is a heavy word, and I just need to be sure before I say something like that, you know?"
    mc "爱是个很沉重的字眼，我在说这种话之前必须要有十足的把握。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:688
translate chinese ep3part2_60e286e6:

    # n "Fair dinkum, mate. I appreciate the honesty."
    n "说得很对，伙计。谢谢你跟我说实话。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:689
translate chinese ep3part2_3207158e:

    # n "It's a heavy word indeed, and it's too easy to throw it around without realizing its weight."
    n "这个字的确很有分量，现在有太多人没意识到这一点，随便乱说爱。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:690
translate chinese ep3part2_8f81aa44:

    # n "It's just... it's somethin' I needed to hear and to consider. I respect ya more for givin' me a true answer."
    n "我就是……就是想问问这个问题，好好思考一下。谢谢你给了我诚实的回答。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:693
translate chinese ep3part2_ada7816d_1:

    # n "Let's shake a leg, yeah? We need to get cleaned up. We've got some lunch to catch up on."
    n "我们走吧？得把身上洗干净。之后还要吃午饭。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:706
translate chinese ep3part2_1d3b561f:

    # mc "Was that all for today?"
    mc "今天就到这了吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:707
translate chinese ep3part2_b8e2cce3:

    # n "Yeah, for the moment. Just needed her to start without a hitch."
    n "嗯，暂时就这些了。只要能让她正常启动就行了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:708
translate chinese ep3part2_91699e57:

    # n "Gonna be up for lendin' a hand again?"
    n "之后还会再来帮忙吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:709
translate chinese ep3part2_17bcbaf6:

    # mc "Of course. Feel free to message me anytime. I'll let you know if or when I'm free."
    mc "当然。你随时都可以给我发消息。我有空就能过来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:710
translate chinese ep3part2_55e7e2b5:

    # n "Will do."
    n "好嘞。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:714
translate chinese ep3part2_4dfec678:

    # n "How about after this? Any plans, [mc]?"
    n "之后你有什么计划吗，[mc!t]？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:715
translate chinese ep3part2_543cb771:

    # mc "Not in particular."
    mc "没什么特别的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:716
translate chinese ep3part2_10e441b5:

    # mc "I was granted a day off by my boss as thanks for assisting a colleague with airport transit."
    mc "今天我送了一个同事去机场，老板为了谢我，给我放了一天假。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:717
translate chinese ep3part2_63d76bdc:

    # mc "Also, I am officially off duty tomorrow, so I'm unoccupied for two days straight."
    mc "然后明天我也休假，所以我连着两天都不用上班。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:725
translate chinese naomishowerfix_4e51f3f3:

    # mc "I'll check if I have anything scheduled though, just in case I overlooked something."
    mc "不过我还是看看我有没有什么安排吧，万一有什么事忘了就不好了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:729
translate chinese naomishowerfix_d24bc72b:

    # mc "Let's see..."
    mc "我看看啊……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:730
translate chinese naomishowerfix_c03757c2:

    # n "The room's gettin' all ripe with the scent of motor oil and sweat, [mc]. Reckon we oughta freshen up."
    n "房间里都要全是机油味和汗味了，[mc!t]。别忘了我们得去洗澡。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:734
translate chinese naomishowerfix_cc3094ba:

    # mc "Please, after you. I didn't get my hands as dirty as you did."
    mc "好的，你先请吧。我身上没有你脏。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:738
translate chinese naomishowerfix_dd49eb8a:

    # n "Ooh, ever the gentleman."
    n "噢，一直都这么绅士啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:741
translate chinese naomishowerfix_2f7fb083:

    # mc "Yep, nothing on my calendar."
    mc "嗯，我的确没有安排。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:744
translate chinese naomishowerfix_bfe31912:

    # mc "Why did you ask-"
    mc "你为什么要问——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:747
translate chinese naomishowerfix_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:748
translate chinese naomishowerfix_bb2cf764:

    # n "..."
    n "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:751
translate chinese naomishowerfix_a578cc58:

    # n "Ya plannin' to stay there gawkin', mobile in hand, jaw on the floor? Or y'thinkin' of joinin' me for a shower?"
    n "你是打算一直在那拿着手机，张着大嘴盯着看呢？还是打算跟我一起洗澡呢？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:758
translate chinese naomishowerfix_8b525948:

    # mc "Standing..."
    mc "站起来了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:759
translate chinese naomishowerfix_87a6fe0c:

    # n "Standing?"
    n "站起来？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:760
translate chinese naomishowerfix_6a6e81eb:

    # mc "It's standing-"
    mc "要站起来了——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:761
translate chinese naomishowerfix_53580b6a:

    # mc "No, I mean shower. Yes, shower!"
    mc "不是，我是说洗澡。对，洗澡！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:765
translate chinese naomishowerfix_2021f722:

    # yt "Am I really gonna turn down this golden opportunity?"
    yt "我真的要拒绝这绝佳的机会吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:766
translate chinese naomishowerfix_5a9df5fe:

    # yt "Well... it's probably best not to tempt fate and push things too far, right?"
    yt "嗯……现在最好还是不要做太过火的事吧？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:767
translate chinese naomishowerfix_908852ae:

    # yt "I don't think she would like that, would she?"
    yt "她应该不会喜欢那样吧？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:768
translate chinese naomishowerfix_29f557a9:

    # mc "As tempting as that sounds... I think it's best you go first, Naomi."
    mc "虽然你的提议很诱人……但最好还是你先去洗吧，娜奥米。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:769
translate chinese naomishowerfix_5be8d6ae:

    # mc "Let's not get any crazy ideas so quickly after we just had a heart-to-heart."
    mc "我们才刚谈过心，还是不要做一些太过头的事了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:772
translate chinese naomishowerfix_1f62e4d8:

    # n "Fair dinkum, mate."
    n "说得也是，伙计。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:773
translate chinese naomishowerfix_7249f43b:

    # n "Other blokes would probably call you a drongo for sayin' that, but I respect yer reasoning."
    n "其他男人可能觉得你这么说是个傻蛋，但我尊重你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:774
translate chinese naomishowerfix_88aadc0d:

    # n "Now don't be sayin' that then be a peeping tom while I'm in there!"
    n "但是你可别嘴上这么说，之后又跑去偷看我！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:775
translate chinese naomishowerfix_a188bd70:

    # mc "*chuckles* Don't worry, Naomi. I won't try to crack onto you."
    mc "*笑* 别担心，娜奥米。我不会做那种事的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:776
translate chinese naomishowerfix_13416115:

    # n "Good on ya, mate!"
    n "那就好，伙计！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:780
translate chinese naomishowerfix_7c267443:

    # yt "Did she just say what I think she said?"
    yt "她刚刚……我没听错吧？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:781
translate chinese naomishowerfix_ce0b88e0:

    # yt "Join her? Is that even a question?"
    yt "跟她一起？这还用问吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:782
translate chinese naomishowerfix_48ab5814:

    # yt "I am a guy with functioning eyes. And a functioning dick. So the answer is \"hell yes, let's go\"!"
    yt "我的眼睛一切正常。性功能也一切正常。所以答案肯定是“太他妈要一起了，走起”！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:783
translate chinese naomishowerfix_149b2cdf:

    # yt "But make sure to play it cool, [mc]."
    yt "但是你可得冷静，千万别丢脸，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:784
translate chinese naomishowerfix_3a17010e:

    # mc "Hell yeah!"
    mc "太他妈要一起了，走起！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:785
translate chinese naomishowerfix_582e1735:

    # yt "... Wow. Real cool. Thanks a lot, brain."
    yt "……哇哦。太冷静了。我谢谢你啊，大脑。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:788
translate chinese naomishowerfix_45c45312:

    # n "*chuckles* Alright then, let's get cleaned up."
    n "*笑* 好，那就去把身上洗干净吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:789
translate chinese naomishowerfix_44ccf145:

    # n "Or maybe get a little dirtier... Who knows?"
    n "或者，也可能是再弄得更脏点……谁知道呢？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:793
translate chinese naomishowerfix_f4187ec7:

    # "With that, Naomi disappears into the bathroom, leaving the door open behind her."
    "话音刚落，娜奥米的身影就消失在浴室里，你和她之间只隔着一扇没有关上的门。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:794
translate chinese naomishowerfix_db8c5cd0:

    # "Before your brain knows what's happening, your body jumps up and makes a beeline for the door."
    "你的大脑还没反应过来，身体却已经跳了起来，朝着浴室的门冲去。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:798
translate chinese naomishowerfix_c0466564:

    # "Just as you enter the doorway, you feel something hit your face and obscure your vision."
    "你刚踏进去，就被不知道什么东西蒙住了脸。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:799
translate chinese naomishowerfix_071178ef:

    # mc "Whoa! Hey!"
    mc "啊！喂！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:800
translate chinese naomishowerfix_b055aeb2:

    # n "Ah ah, not so fast, [mc]. What's the first rule before hoppin' in the shower?"
    n "哎哎哎，别急，[mc!t]。洗澡之前的第一条规矩是什么？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:801
translate chinese naomishowerfix_6b0ed824:

    # mc "Um..."
    mc "呃……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:805
translate chinese naomishowerfix_e7ab5e1a:

    # "You reach up to remove the object from your face, then check to see what it is: a bath towel."
    "你伸手拿掉了盖在脸上的东西，定睛一看：是一条浴巾。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:806
translate chinese naomishowerfix_5dc3c704:

