    s "站起来，别看电脑了，和我一起下楼吃饭。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1889
translate chinese moonpause3_846110f9:

    # a "Okay, I'll be right-"
    a "好，我马上——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1893
translate chinese moonpause3_48c12745:

    # s "No! Do it now!"
    s "不行！现在就去！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1895
translate chinese moonpause3_2ecd8b46:

    # s "You may be the one calling the shots in the harem, but I'm still your boss. And as your boss, I'm concerned about your health."
    s "虽然在后宫里发号施令的是你，但我也还是你的上司。作为你的上司，我很担心你的身体。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1896
translate chinese moonpause3_00581b6d:

    # s "I won't coddle you like [mc] does."
    s "我不会像[mc!t]一样惯着你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1897
translate chinese moonpause3_7dc18a72:

    # a "... Okay."
    a "……好吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1901
translate chinese moonpause3_bb8e4b4e_1:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1904
translate chinese moonpause3_169b6689:

    # s "I just noticed, but you look really pale, and..."
    s "我才注意到，你的脸色好苍白，而且……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1907
translate chinese moonpause3_70d941cb:

    # s "Aine?"
    s "艾妮？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1914
translate chinese moonpause3_56b74a30:

    # s "Ah, uhm...!"
    s "啊，这……！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1917
translate chinese moonpause3_012d3a5d:

    # s "[mc]! [landlady]! Someone! Aine needs help!"
    s "[mc!t]！[landlady!t]！来人啊！艾妮出事了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1964
translate chinese moonpause3_0ac4657a:

    # a "*gasps*"
    a "*干呕*"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1965
translate chinese moonpause3_a1798970:

    # mc "Aine? You okay? You looked like you were-"
    mc "艾妮？没事吧？你好像——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1968
translate chinese moonpause3_acda9f4c:

    # a "Mmp!"
    a "唔！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1974
translate chinese moonpause3_1a5914e8:

    # mc "Wait! We haven't... even reached the point yet..."
    mc "等一下啊！我们俩还没……走到那一步啊……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1978
translate chinese moonpause3_c1c6cc4e:

    # mc "Hey, you're not... pregnant, are you? Because, you know, we haven't-"
    mc "那个，你……肯定不会是怀孕了吧？因为，我们，还没有——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1979
translate chinese moonpause3_99536a06:

    # a "[mc], can we not do this now, please?"
    a "[mc!t]，现在能先别这样吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1980
translate chinese moonpause3_9ca28b71:

    # mc "I'm just trying to lighten the mood a little."
    mc "我就是想活跃一下气氛。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1981
translate chinese moonpause3_a50d92a0:

    # mc "But seriously, are you going to tell me what's wrong, or are we playing the silent game?"
    mc "不过说正经的，你是要一直沉默吗？可不可以告诉我怎么回事？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1986
translate chinese moonpause3_fc4ea71b:

    # s "What's all the commotion? I could hear doors slamming from..."
    s "在闹什么呢？我离大老远都能听见……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1989
translate chinese moonpause3_b2dcfe05:

    # s "Oh..."
    s "噢……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1990
translate chinese moonpause3_3ee32121:

    # mc "You good?"
    mc "好点了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1991
translate chinese moonpause3_2e9fab40:

    # a "Y...yeah... I'm fine now. Thanks."
    a "是……是的……我没事了。谢谢。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1994
translate chinese moonpause3_8a18769a:

    # s "*sigh* Well, isn't this perfect timing..."
    s "*叹气* 正好赶上……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1995
translate chinese moonpause3_39a6d811:

    # s "I've been thinking, and I've already explained your situation to the management and the director approved my request right away."
    s "我考虑了很久，刚刚已经把你的情况跟上面解释过了，领导立马就同意了我的请求。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1996
translate chinese moonpause3_849b6726:

    # s "So, I'm granting you a week off, Aine."
    s "所以，我要给你放一周的假，艾妮。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1997
translate chinese moonpause3_e690d54e:

    # a "But I-"
    a "可是我——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1998
translate chinese moonpause3_0be49975:

    # s "Ah-! Enough."
    s "啊啊啊！够了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:1999
translate chinese moonpause3_8c761b04:

    # s "I'm exhausted too, and I won't entertain any of your excuses. Not anymore."
    s "我也很累，不想再听你找理由了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2000
translate chinese moonpause3_69a8d4ff:

    # s "Take the week, rest, and recover. If I catch you so much as glancing at work, consider yourself on a longer forced break. Capiche?"
    s "就用这个星期好好休息，恢复一下。如果我再抓到你偷偷工作，我就再强制你休更久的假。明白没？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2003
translate chinese moonpause3_bb8e4b4e_2:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2004
translate chinese moonpause3_9d2ade31:

    # s "I've never figured out what you two see in each other, but I bet it's that shared stubborn streak."
    s "我之前总想不明白你们两个是怎么看对眼的，现在算是知道了，两个人一样固执。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2005
translate chinese moonpause3_d438eb47:

    # s "Take that as you will."
    s "我话说完了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2008
translate chinese moonpause3_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2009
translate chinese moonpause3_a57c5dbc:

    # yt "... She really can step up when it matters."
    yt "……她在关键时刻真是能挺身而出。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2013
translate chinese moonpause3_dd2aa870:

    # mc "Well, you heard her..."
    mc "好了，就听她的话吧……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2014
translate chinese moonpause3_17fe68a2:

    # mc "After everything we've been through, here we are, Aine. Why doubt that I'll be here for you now?"
    mc "我们一起经历了那么多，都已经走到这一步了，艾妮。为什么你还是不愿意依靠我呢？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2017
translate chinese moonpause3_bb8e4b4e_3:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2020
translate chinese moonpause3_38eee0d8:

    # a "You could probably guess. It's this job of mine."
    a "你估计也能猜到。是因为我的工作。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2021
translate chinese moonpause3_ee531c4e:

    # a "Of course, I don't blame it. It is just my job, after all."
    a "当然，我不是埋怨。毕竟是工作。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2022
translate chinese moonpause3_25d4b9f6:

    # a "But like anyone, I get tired. The exhaustion messes with my head, and when it gets too much, it drags me back to... darker times."
    a "但我和其他人一样，也会累。一累，就会胡思乱想，等累过头之后，我就被拖回了那段……黑暗的时光。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2026
translate chinese moonpause3_80fe8032:

    # a "Times that involve us."
    a "有关我们俩的那段时光。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2027
translate chinese moonpause3_66ab760c:

    # mc "Elaborate for me?"
    mc "详细说说？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2031
translate chinese moonpause3_df578347:

    # a "One time, I had a dream. It was like a memory of you walking away because of who I am..."
    a "有一次，我做了个梦。梦里你在发现我的真面目之后，离我而去……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2032
translate chinese moonpause3_6ae3e13d:

    # a "Today, it was about high school..."
    a "今天，我又梦到了高中的时候……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2033
translate chinese moonpause3_8f644aa7:

    # mc "The high school days, huh?"
    mc "高中啊……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2034
translate chinese moonpause3_fce99d55:

    # a "Exactly."
    a "是的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2035
translate chinese moonpause3_b2dbef13:

    # mc "... I understand."
    mc "……我懂的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2038
translate chinese moonpause3_a165ac0b:

    # a "It's always the same, coming out of nowhere."
    a "总是这样，莫名其妙的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2039
translate chinese moonpause3_21d896ec:

    # a "I can't stop it. And I don't know why it happens."
    a "我阻止不了。我都不知道为什么会出这种事。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2042
translate chinese moonpause3_c0a754f1:

    # mc "I know why it happens."
    mc "我知道为什么。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2043
translate chinese moonpause3_17fc462e:

    # mc "When you're stressed like this, you fall back into old habits. That drags up the past, doesn't it?"
    mc "你压力大的时候，就会重拾旧习惯。然后自然而然地就想起了过去。是这样吧？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2046
translate chinese moonpause3_bb8e4b4e_4:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2047
translate chinese moonpause3_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2052
translate chinese moonpause3_4bf971fd:

    # mc "You know what I think?"
    mc "要我说……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2053
translate chinese moonpause3_b588bb54:

    # mc "I think you should strongly consider taking up Sky's suggestion."
    mc "你绝对应该考虑一下斯凯的提议。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2057
translate chinese moonpause3_25bfefde:

    # mc "You've been pretty on edge lately, haven't you, my cranky little miss?"
    mc "你最近实在把自己逼得太紧了，对不对，这位爱发脾气的小姐？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2060
translate chinese moonpause3_5ea849d3:

    # a "You can still tease at a time like this?"
    a "都这时候了你还不忘逗我啊？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2061
translate chinese moonpause3_cf8bbbbd:

    # mc "Would never miss a chance to do so."
    mc "我不会错过任何一个机会。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2062
translate chinese moonpause3_c235b87f:

    # mc "But seriously, what do you think about Sky's suggestion?"
    mc "不过说正经的，你对斯凯的建议是什么看法？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2063
translate chinese moonpause3_a4644096:

    # mc "That week off might be just what you need to feel like yourself again."
    mc "休息一周应该就能让你重新找回状态了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2064
translate chinese moonpause3_3d21face:

    # mc "Take a rest. You'll be back to normal sooner than you think."
    mc "歇歇吧。你很快就能恢复正常的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2067
translate chinese moonpause3_30230e0b:

    # a "It's not just about resting, [mc]. I've been so buried in work that I feel trapped."
    a "不是只要休息就行的，[mc!t]。我最近太专注于工作了，感觉像是被死死困住了一样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2068
translate chinese moonpause3_c2ada682:

    # a "... Well, if we're being honest, I've been using work as an excuse to prevent myself from going out, even though I've been dying to."
    a "……说实话，我是用工作当借口，好让我自己没理由出门，尽管我特别特别想出去。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2069
translate chinese moonpause3_fd0f6ad0:

    # a "Emma's plan gave me freedom, sure, but now... I'm suffocating."
    a "艾玛的计划的确给我了自由，可是现在……我却快窒息了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2075
translate chinese moonpause3_2ba00d36:

    # mc "That's it? You've been holding back all this because you didn't want to step outside?"
    mc "就这？原来你忍受这么多只是因为不想出门而已？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2076
translate chinese moonpause3_93e18c6e:

    # a "[mc], it's not that simple. You know the risks if I'm seen."
    a "[mc!t]，没那么简单。你清楚的，如果我被发现了，会有大麻烦。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2077
translate chinese moonpause3_8e04f5aa:

    # mc "But things have changed, Aine. We can manage it differently now."
    mc "但是情况已经变了，艾妮。我们现在有办法了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2078
translate chinese moonpause3_25666fe1:

    # a "You mean...? Oh no, [mc], we can't possibly impose on her."
    a "你是说……？不行不行，[mc!t]，我们不能给她添麻烦。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2079
translate chinese moonpause3_03e61b37:

    # mc "Why not? She said to ask if I needed anything."
    mc "有什么不行的？她说了如果我有需要就去找她。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2080
translate chinese moonpause3_77aea3cc:

    # a "... Fine, but only if she really means it. If there's even a hint of reluctance, I won't go through with it."
    a "……好吧，但是必须她完全同意才行。哪怕她有一丁点不情愿，我都不会继续。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2081
translate chinese moonpause3_cc9feb53:

    # mc "And I wouldn't want you to. We'll do this right, Aine, or not at all."
    mc "那正合我意。我们要么就好好做，要么就不做，艾妮。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2082
translate chinese moonpause3_a8657bc4:

    # mc "Deal?"
    mc "那就说定了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2083
translate chinese moonpause3_6a9417aa:

    # a "Jeez... How can I say no to that? The outside world, finally..."
    a "啊……我怎么能说不呢？终于能见到外面的世界了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2084
translate chinese moonpause3_6719da3d:

    # a "Alright, deal!"
    a "嗯，就这么定了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2089
translate chinese moonpause3_333bccdb:

    # mc "Alright, why don't you rest first? Once you recover, let's plan it out. How's that sound?"
    mc "好吧，总之你先休息一下如何？等你恢复之后，我们再做打算。怎么样？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2090
translate chinese moonpause3_ca72f8f8:

    # a "*sighs* A week? What am I going to do for a week?"
    a "*叹气* 整整一个星期啊？我哪能打发一个星期的时间？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2097
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_6beae87d:

    # mc "Have you always been this driven?"
    mc "你一直都这么喜欢工作吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2098
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_abf5bc38:

    # a "What, are you surprised? I have to be. Living and eating aren't free, [mc]."
    a "怎么，你很惊讶吗？我必须如此。住处跟食物都是要花钱的，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2099
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_cd1ba224:

    # mc "I knew you were dedicated, but this is... intense."
    mc "我知道你很上心，但这也……太过头了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2100
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_d8240346:

    # a "Normally, it's fine, but sometimes it just gets too much."
    a "一般来说是没什么问题的，只是有时候会稍微有些承受不住。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2106
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_a6fe7bb9:

    # mc "Not this again... How often has it happened this week?"
    mc "怎么又来……这是这星期第几次了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2107
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_510178a7:

    # a "Excluding the scheduled blackouts?"
    a "带不带上提前通知的停电？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2108
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_4fa0defe:

    # mc "Uh-huh...?"
    mc "呃，要是不带呢……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2109
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_b258652a:

    # a "This is the fourth time. For unscheduled blackouts, at least."
    a "只算突然停电的话，这是第四次了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2110
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_dfdc9ccc:

    # a "Considering that noise, it should be the whole city."
    a "听外面的动静，应该是全市都停了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2114
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_df0b790e:

    # mc "Stay here. I'll be right back to turn on the backup power."
    mc "你先坐着。我去把后备电源打开，马上回来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2118
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_52fc12ea:

    # a "Wait! Where are you going?"
    a "等一下！你要去哪？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2119
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_1538a9c4:

    # mc "Basement. Gonna switch on the backup generator."
    mc "地下室。得去开备用发电机。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2122
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_4431e2b7:

    # a "No, let someone else handle it. Just... stay, please."
    a "不要，让别人去处理吧。留下来吧……求你了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2123
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2124
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_ff375465:

    # mc "... Okay, I'll stay."
    mc "……好，我不走。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2128
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_1282cdd1:

    # yt "Is she scared, or is it what I think it is?"
    yt "她是在害怕，还是说是我想的那样？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2131
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_3323826f:

    # mc "Aine."
    mc "艾妮。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2132
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_32fb53c2:

    # a "Hm?"
    a "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2133
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_dece476d:

    # mc "Are you sure you're fine with just sitting like this in pitch blackness?"
    mc "你就打算一直这么坐在一片漆黑里吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2134
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_ecf8ef49:

    # a "Y-yes... as long as you're here."
    a "对-对啊……只要有你在就好。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2135
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_f447d6d6:

    # yt "Hesitation, yet a clear admission. I'm starting to think it isn't her fear speaking."
    yt "有些犹豫，但却明确承认了。我开始觉得她说这话并不是因为害怕了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2136
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_318711d7:

    # yt "In that case, it can only be one thing."
    yt "那样的话，就只可能有一个原因。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2139
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_0c382ff8:

    # "A bemused smile flits across your face as you pick up on the true motivation behind her behavior."
    "你理解了她的行为背后的真意，脸上划过一抹会心的笑。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2140
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_19e4bd56:

    # "If your hunch is correct, then these next few minutes could be a lot of fun and reveal more about Aine's personality than she knows."
    "如果你的直觉没错，那接下来的几分钟将会十分有趣，并且也能揭晓出艾妮性格中连她自己都不知道的一面。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2143
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_f47b8822:

    # mc "But you know, anything can happen when the lights are out..."
    mc "不过呢，在黑暗里，什么都有可能发生……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2144
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_b414588c:

    # "You gauge your options as you tease your fiancée with your words."
    "你一边用言语挑逗着你的未婚妻，一边思考着接下来的行动。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2145
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_ee1f84bf:

    # mc "Something, or someone, can exploit your defenselessness..."
    mc "可能会有人趁你没有防备，做起坏事来……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2149
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_572756fd:

    # "You slide your fingers along her cheek, pulling her face closer."
    "你用手指滑过她的脸颊，把她的脸拉近。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2150
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_dad89c30:

    # "Even in the darkness, you can sense the desperation in her body language."
