# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2938
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_af195911:

    # a "I was hoping she hadn't replaced The Rustic Stave with... this."
    a "我正希望她可千万不要把乡村木桶换成……这个呢。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:2944
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_e1f43233:

    # a "Excuse me, sorry to bother you, but do you happen to know where The Rustic Stave is?"
