translate chinese crackinganaineopen_691e19f1:

    # gun "I need money, okay? Everything's gone wrong."
    gun "我想要钱。我的人生全乱套了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3038
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_1f96f27e:

    # a "I get it. Life can be overwhelming. But there must be a better way to react than this."
    a "我懂的。生活很困难。但肯定也不至于到做这种事的地步。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3042
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_bbad1203:

    # gun "You don't know anything about my life!"
    gun "你又了解我的什么！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3043
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_0ee28656:

    # a "Maybe not. But I do know what despair looks like. I see it in your eyes."
    a "我可能的确不了解。但我知道绝望是什么样子。我就在你的眼里看到了绝望。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3044
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_28b25407:

    # a "You're not a bad person. You're just desperate."
    a "你不是个坏人。只是走投无路了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3047
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_c6385764:

    # gun "Y-you think you can read my mind, huh? You don't know me!"
    gun "你-你觉得你能知道我在想什么吗？你根本就不了解我！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3050
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_ad2861f6:

    # a "I don't. But I do know that hurting others or yourself isn't the answer."
    a "是的。但是我知道，伤害别人也好，伤害自己也好，都不会是正确答案。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3051
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_a7e40a03:

    # a "What happened to you? What brought you so low that you think this is your only option?"
    a "你遇到什么事了？是什么让你觉得，你只剩下这一个办法了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3055
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_83da875f:

    # gun "Shut up! You don't understand!"
    gun "闭嘴！你不懂！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3056
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_915e6ed7:

    # a "I understand more than you think I do. I see a man who's lost, who thinks there's no hope. But this? This is just cowardice."
    a "我比你想的要懂得多。我看到了一个迷失的男人，认为自己已经没有希望了。可是你这样做只是懦弱之举。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3057
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_5d56bb58:

    # gun "Stop... stop saying that!"
    gun "不要……不要再说了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3060
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_3d202c1f:

    # a "It's the truth. You're acting out of fear."
    a "这是事实。你的行为是出于恐惧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3061
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_7bdd8560:

    # a "You think this gun gives you power? No-all it does is reveal your weakness."
    a "你认为这把枪会给你力量吗？不，它只会揭露你的弱点。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3062
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_05839324:

    # a "Look at you, a pathetic being clinging to a gun because you can't face your failures."
    a "你看看你，因为没法面对失败，就把一切都赌在一把枪上，真是可悲。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3063
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_81531822:

    # a "You're not just desperate: you're pitiful. Using threats to feel important? That's just sad."
    a "你不仅是走投无路了，还很可怜。是想靠威胁来觉得自己很重要吗？太可悲了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3064
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_ddd19cfc:

    # gun "I... I..."
    gun "我……我……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3067
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_67bbf2af:

    # a "You what? Can't handle the truth?"
    a "你怎么？接受不了事实吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3068
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_8ef503a6:

    # a "You're a coward, hiding behind a weapon, thinking it makes you strong."
    a "你就是个懦夫，躲在武器后面，觉得自己很强。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3069
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_bf0fb02e:

    # a "It's truly laughable. You're nothing but a scared little boy, trembling at the thought of facing the real world."
    a "真是可笑啊。你就是个被吓坏的小男孩，光是想到面对现实这一个念头，就怕到浑身发抖。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3072
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_e35d79be:

    # a "And let's not forget why you couldn't find a job. It's not because there weren't any; It's because you weren't good enough for them."
    a "你也千万别忘了你找不到工作的原因。不是因为没有工作机会；而是因为你的能力不足以胜任。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3073
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_d6ffdab3:

    # a "You probably walked into every interview already defeated, reeking of desperation and incompetence."
    a "你可能在参加面试之前就已经失败了，因为你身上只散发着绝望和无能的味道啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3074
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_83d08dac:

    # a "Employers can smell failure a mile away. And you? You're drenched in it."
    a "老板们离得老远就能闻到失败的气息。而你呢？你是刚从失败的粪坑里爬出来吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3075
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_81db3c89:

    # a "Is that why you're doing this? To prove to yourself that you can accomplish something, even if it's just terrorizing innocent people?"
    a "所以你才会做这种事吗？你想证明你也是能把事情做成的，尽管只是威胁无辜的人而已？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3079
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_65e79965:

    # gun "Stop... Please..."
    gun "别说了……求你了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3082
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_7ae9c2d7:

    # a "Oh, now you want pity? After all this? After threatening an innocent woman and dragging us into your mess?"
    a "哦，现在你开始装可怜了？你刚刚不还威胁无辜的女人，还想把我们也卷进你的烂摊子里吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3083
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_8c900bfb:

    # a "You don't deserve pity. You don't deserve understanding. You don't deserve to live."
    a "你不配被可怜。你不配被理解。你都不配活着。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3084
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_4dc68cec:

    # a "You're just a pathetic, sniveling mess."
    a "你就是个可悲，还爱哭鼻子的废物。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3085
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_6c59a2b6:

    # a "You call yourself a man? A man faces his problems. You're just a child playing with a gun."
    a "你觉得自己是个男人吗？男人是会直面问题的。你只是个把枪当玩具的小孩。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3089
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_8b2f03f8:

    # gun "Hrrnn!"
    gun "啊啊啊啊！！！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3092
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_4f7204a2:

    # a "Go ahead. Do you think I care?"
    a "来啊。你觉得我会怕？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3093
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_5c5c4a12:

    # a "You pull that trigger, I'm finally free from this god-forsaken life. It's a win for me."
    a "只要你扣了扳机，我就终于能从这狗屎一样的生活里解脱了。我很满意啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3094
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_fdbbf24f:

    # a "My life, your life, it doesn't matter anymore, does it?"
    a "我的命也好，你的命也好，都无所谓了，对不对？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3095
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_3b694252:

    # a "But think about it. What will you gain by shooting me? A moment of control? Is it worth it?"
    a "但是你仔细想想。你开枪打死我，对你有什么好处？一瞬间的掌控感？值得吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3096
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_408763a4:

    # a "Think about the consequences. You shoot me, and then what? Police swarm in and arrest you in front of everyone, sweeping away the only shards of dignity you have left."
    a "想想后果。你打死我，然后呢？警察蜂拥而至，在大家面前逮捕你，彻底毁掉你仅剩的最后一点尊严。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3097
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_48aceb06:

    # a "Then you rot away your life in jail-if you're lucky."
    a "然后，如果你足够幸运的话，也只是烂在监狱里，直到死去。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3098
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_3d46560d:

    # a "If someone decides to take their anger out on you, or make you their prison slave, you'll find yourself begging for the merciful release that death provides."
    a "如果有狱友决定拿你撒气，或者把你当成奴隶使唤，那到时候你反而会觉得要是死了才好呢。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3099
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_f07eafc8:

    # a "And your family... do they know what you've been reduced to? What will this do to them?"
    a "还有你的家人……他们知道你堕落成什么样子了吗？他们知道之后会怎么样？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3102
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_61c53614:

    # gun "I... I don't have a choice..."
    gun "我……我没得选……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3103
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_353b0748:

    # a "You always have a choice. This isn't just about you. It's about everyone you're dragging down with you."
    a "你总是有选择的。这并非只是你一个人的事。而是事关被你卷进来的所有人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3104
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_12097782:

    # gun "My family... I didn't think..."
    gun "我的家人……我没有想到……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3105
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_614df0db:

    # a "See? There's more to this than just your own pain. Think about who else gets hurt."
    a "看吧？不是只有你一个人的痛苦而已。想想其他可能会受到伤害的人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3106
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_546603db:

    # gun "Maybe... maybe I'm the one who should be... No, I can't even do this right..."
    gun "说不定……说不定我才应该……不，我连这个都做不好……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3107
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_a1b7e684:

    # a "That's not the answer either. Hurting yourself won't fix anything."
    a "那也不是答案。伤害自己也解决不了任何事。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3108
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_8192bf39:

    # a "It's not too late to make a different choice."
    a "现在改变还来得及。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3112
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_839020d5:

    # gun "NO, I SHOULD END THIS RIGHT HERE, RIGHT NOW!"
    gun "{b}不，我要就在这里，就现在，结束一切！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3125
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_831015a6:

    # yt "Shit! Aine's words didn't work as intended."
    yt "妈的！艾妮的话没起到预期的效果。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3126
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_33fe8745:

    # yt "No, I should keep it calm..."
    yt "不行，我要保持冷静……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3127
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_75bfe136:

    # yt "Think, [mc], think. There must be a way to defuse this without hurting anyone."
    yt "思考，[mc!t]，思考。肯定有办法在不伤害任何人的情况下解决。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3135
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_05f0cf21:

    # yt "..."
    yt "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3136
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_c3c1cf3c:

    # yt "A pebble? That's all we have?"
    yt "鹅卵石？只能用这个？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3137
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_a314e8f7:

    # yt "It might be enough, but I can't direct Moon fast enough in this situation."
    yt "可能足够了，但这种情况下我没法及时给月指示。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3138
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_cad1c1a4:

    # yt "I don't know how strong she is yet, so we can't risk hitting him directly either."
    yt "我还不知道她具体有多强，所以也不能冒险直接去打他。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3141
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_c979283f:

    # yt "If Moon aims for his hand or the gun, it could cause a reflex that would make him pull the trigger. That would certainly escalate things."
    yt "如果月瞄准他的手或者枪，可能会引发条件反射，让他开枪。那样的话绝对会让事情闹大。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3142
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_662141d0:

    # yt "I don't know what we're in for, then..."
    yt "那样的话我们的介入也就没有意义了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3143
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_ce6797ca:

    # yt "We only need something to knock him out."
    yt "我们只需要把他弄晕。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3150
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_0d066d1e:

    # yt "Something... to knock him out..."
    yt "把他……弄晕……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3151
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_4a1d4b25:

    # yt "That... That's what we need!"
    yt "对……就是那个！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3167
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_96314b0d:

    # m "*shivers*"
    m "*颤抖*"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3170
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_02c96d1b:

    # mc "Look at me. This isn't the way out that you think it is..."
    mc "你看着我。并不是这样就能解脱了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3172
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_6af8ccd9:

    # gun "W-what do you fucking know?!"
    gun "你-你他妈又懂什么？！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3173
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_fc35fff3:

    # yt "I got his attention!"
    yt "我吸引到他的注意了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3179
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_4e889084:

    # yt "Now, Moon! It's now or never!"
    yt "就是现在，月！不要错过这个机会！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3180
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_b61af394:

    # m "Thank thee for the blessing, the vigor I wield..."
    m "感谢你的赐福，我充沛的精力……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3183
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_eb67e8cd:

    # m "In the day's honest toil, across the expansive field..."
    m "在广阔的田野上，不辞辛苦地劳作……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3187
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_d3c4bebe:

    # m "May the soft day enfold each toil and endeavor..."
    m "愿温柔的日子，拥抱每一份辛劳与努力……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3189
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_28705023:

    # gun "What the-?"
    gun "什么——？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3190
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_96ecd991:

    # m "As I fulfil my role, the bringer of light."
    m "我会履行我的职责，成为光的使者。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3201
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_cc508706:

    # m "Amen."
    m "阿门。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3204
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_52a8b409:

    # mc "She's not human... I didn't even see her move."
    mc "她简直不是人类……我根本没看到她在动。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3205
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_a2dc59bd:

    # a "That was incredible... She just used the hilt of her sword and then he collapsed."
    a "太厉害了……她只用刀柄就把那人打倒了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3208
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_4c9bf108:

    # mc "What do you have, eagle eyes? How could you catch that?"
    mc "你还有鹰眼啊？你是怎么看清楚的？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3209
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_da4c8acb:

    # a "Maybe I'm just more observant than you. Or maybe you need glasses."
    a "可能我只是观察力比你强。也可能你该戴眼镜了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3210
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_2d387466:

    # mc "Observant or superhuman? She was faster than a blink."
    mc "你的观察力得好到超人的程度吧。她的动作比眨眼还快。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3211
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_17c8d50f:

    # a "Well, we can't all be as quick as her, but some of us can keep up."
    a "我们没法都跟她一样快，但光是眼睛的话还是有人能跟得上的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3212
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_d2f9361e:

    # mc "I'll believe it when I see it - which, at this rate, will be never."
    mc "我还是觉得要眼见为实——只是按现在的情况来看，估计我永远也没法亲眼看见了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3224
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_39efdc8c:

    # off "Alright, tell me what happened."
    off "把情况跟我说一下吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3227
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_43076a0b:

    # mc "We were near Alla Moda when we heard a scream. That's when we saw the man with the gun."
    mc "我们正打算去奥拉摩达，然后就听到了尖叫声。之后就看到那个男的手里拿着枪。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3228
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_a3c1f0cf:

    # off "Was he making any specific threats or demands?"
    off "他有做出什么明确的威胁或者要求吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3229
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_43cf018a:

    # a "He appeared desperate, threatening the woman he had grabbed. Mainly for money, it seemed."
    a "他一幅歇斯底里的样子，一直在威胁要杀掉被他挟持的女人。似乎主要是为了钱。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3230
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_7b1c5e5e:

    # off "And how did you become involved?"
    off "你们又是怎么参与进去的？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3233
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_53f7e772:

    # a "I offered to switch places with the hostage. I hoped to deescalate the situation through negotiation."
    a "我主动提出要顶替人质。我想跟他谈判，避免事态升级。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3234
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_434b28bf:

    # off "While I understand your intentions, such actions can be hazardous and unpredictable."
    off "我理解你的好意，但是这种行为是很有风险而且难以预料的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3235
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_7316a020:

    # a "It was a spur-of-the-moment decision. He was at the brink of doing something to the woman, and I felt it was the only way to calm him down."
    a "算是我一时冲动吧。他当时差一点就要对那个女人动手了，我觉得只有这一个办法能让他冷静下来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3236
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_b895bad4:

    # mc "Aine managed to get him to release the hostage, but then he turned the gun on himself."
    mc "艾妮让他把人质给放了，但他又突然想对自己开枪。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3237
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_47930802:

    # off "That's a highly volatile situation. How was it resolved without any shots?"
    off "这情况可不好解决啊。最后是怎么在没开枪的情况下解决的呢？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3240
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_11ced3d9:

    # m "I used a pebble to create a distraction. The noise diverted his attention at the critical moment."
    m "我用石头弄出了声响，在关键时刻让他分心了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3241
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_1f4811d5:

    # off "Resourceful, but such actions could have escalated the situation, young lady. It's risky to intervene like that."
    off "很聪明，但这种行为也可能让事态升级的，小姐。这样干预是很危险的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3242
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_cd4bf910:

    # off "And your sword: it's not a real weapon, is it?"
    off "还有你的刀，应该不是真的吧？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3245
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_0281bd70:

    # m "No, officer, it's just for cosmetic purposes."
    m "是的，警官，只是个装饰品。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3246
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_cfd2175f:

    # off "You seem to know how to wield it properly, and took down the suspect despite it being a cosmetic. Care to explain?"
    off "你好像很会用刀啊，只用装饰品就把嫌疑人打倒了。能解释一下吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3249
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_5ba0b56f:

    # m "I am these two's hired bodyguard. I just did what's written in my job description."
    m "我是这两个人雇的保镖。只是在做我该做的工作而已。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3250
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_01146262:

    # off "From what agency, may I ask?"
    off "我能问问你是哪个机构的吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3251
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_e6b75240:

    # m "From \"Sicae Agency\"."
    m "“西卡”。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3252
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_6b4a7ccb:

    # off "I see. No more questions, then."
    off "原来如此。那我就不多问了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3253
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_2c920a8f:

    # yt "Wait, what...?"
    yt "啊？什么……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3256
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_e128bfde:

    # off "Look, while I appreciate that a worse outcome was avoided, I must emphasize that intervening in situations where the suspect is armed is extremely dangerous."
    off "好吧，尽管我很感谢你们避免了更坏的结果出现，但我必须强调，在嫌疑人有武器的情况下还贸然介入，是十分危险的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3257
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_9d9bf36a:

    # off "You put yourselves and the original victim at greater risk."
    off "这样会让你们自己和原本的受害者都面临更大的风险。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3258
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_00ebecc9:

    # off "In the future, the best course of action is to ensure your safety and call us. Allow the professionals to handle the situation."
    off "以后如果再出现这种情况，最合适的行为是确保自己的安全，然后联系我们。让专业的人来处理。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3259
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_38440e40:

    # mc "We understand, officer."
    mc "我们明白了，警官。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3260
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_2adc3c79:

    # off "My partner will take your statements for the official report. I appreciate your cooperation, and please be more cautious in the future."
    off "我的同事会把你们的证词写进官方的报告里。感谢你们的配合，以后一定要多加小心啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3267
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_bb8e4b4e_10:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3268
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_f3b3d28f:

    # mc "What's wrong?"
    mc "怎么了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3271
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_e03c5ec2:

    # a "I keep replaying the words I said to him. They were... incisive and ruthless."
    a "我一直在回想我对他说的话。真的……很刻薄，很残忍。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3272
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_c21d9b32:

    # a "Yes, they helped defuse the situation, but the ease with which I said each word... it scares me."
    a "我的确解决了事件，可我居然能若无其事地说出那种话……把我自己都吓到了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3273
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_d07c1728:

    # mc "Aine, in that moment you did what you thought was necessary."
    mc "艾妮，你只是做了你当时认为有必要做的事。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3274
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_05cab195:

    # a "That's just it, though: my words had a cruel effect. They almost drove the man to a mental breakdown."
    a "可是我说的话的确产生了残酷的效果。差点就把一个男人给逼到崩溃了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3275
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_7c43ad60:

    # a "There's a part of me that can be so detached, so analytical. It's a side I'm scared of."
    a "我居然变得那么冷漠，那么不近人情。我害怕我的这一面。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3276
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_6a537ce2:

    # a "It worked out this time, but what about the future? It could just as easily do harm instead of good."
    a "这次是起效了，可以后呢？很可能不仅没有好处，反而伤害到别人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3277
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_d810db04:

    # a "It's a part of me my mother created for her own purposes, and..."
    a "我的这一部分，是我妈妈为了她的目的打造出来的，而且……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3280
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_d8cc7957:

    # mc "And what?"
    mc "而且什么？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3281
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_e39d3777:

    # a "... You know better than anyone. The damage I've done, the people I've hurt, including you. Especially you."
    a "……你应该比别人都清楚。我犯下了过错，伤害了人，其中就包括你。特别是你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3282
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_20fda8e0:

    # a "[mc], I just..."
    a "[mc!t]，我就是……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3283
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_0932bce3:

    # mc "Tell me."
    mc "说出来吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3286
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_e4a3a5c5:

    # a "I don't know which part of me is really \"me\". The one I want to be, or the one I fear I've become."
    a "我不知道到底哪部分的我才是真的“我”。我有想成为的样子，却也害怕我已经变成了另一种人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3289
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_2b35b6fe_6:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

