    mc "！！！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3302
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_2b35b6fe_7:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3305
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_50dc9f34:

    # mc "Did you guys hear that?"
    mc "你们听到了吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3306
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_32fb53c2_1:

    # a "Hm?"
    a "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3307
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_514df56a:

    # m "I didn't hear anything."
    m "我什么都没听见。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3310
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_2e218250:

    # foff "Alright, you kids. Let's get this done, so you can carry on with your day."
    foff "好了，孩子们。赶快把事情搞定，你们接着去忙你们的事吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3320
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_d40504b2:

    # yu "Well, this is the place."
    yu "就是这里了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3323
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_9aba67d4:

    # a "It hasn't changed one bit. Thanks for guiding us here, Yuki."
    a "这里一点都没有变啊。谢谢你给我们带路，小雪。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3324
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_6e58ac44:

    # yu "Yeah, no big deal. But I think I'll head home after everything that has happened."
    yu "嗯，没什么的。不过，刚经历完这么多事，我想回家了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3325
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_5e319b13:

    # yu "I'm surprised you all treat this like water off a duck's back. After a situation like that, I'd be a wreck."
    yu "我都没想到你们居然一点反应都没有。我都快被吓坏了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3328
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_bfd0fcfb:

    # yt "That is strange, actually. Moon's calmness was expected, but Aine...?"
    yt "其实还真挺奇怪的。月的镇静是理所当然的，可是艾妮呢……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3329
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_432e5850:

    # yt "She's usually not this composed in intense situations. Is she hiding something from me?"
    yt "她在遇上大事的时候一般不会这么平静。她是有事瞒着我吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3332
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_e4a3a5c5_1:

    # a "I don't know which part of me is really \"me\". The one I want to be, or the one I fear I've become."
    a "我不知道到底哪部分的我才是真的“我”。我有想成为的样子，却也害怕我已经变成了另一种人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3335
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_2b35b6fe_8:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3336
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_fa31b7f6:

    # yt "What has Hera exposed her to? How deep does it go...?"
    yt "赫拉都让她见过什么啊？到底有多邪门……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3339
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_4b620fa3:

    # yu "I'll leave you to it, then. Stay safe, okay?"
    yu "我就不打扰你们了。一定要注意安全啊！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3340
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_65acb2eb:

    # a "You too, Yuki. Take care."
    a "你也是，小雪。保重。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3343
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_7bb4857b:

    # mc "I'll be right back. I need to use the restroom."
    mc "我去一下厕所。马上回来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3344
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_45a29562:

    # a "Alright, but don't take too long."
    a "好，别去太久。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3347
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_0e958ecf:

    # a "Okay, where should we-"
    a "那么，我们该——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3351
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_220f9896:

    # a "Ah, you've already picked a table..."
    a "啊，你已经选好桌子了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3354
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_fd37c85c:

    # m "It's the most secure spot here."
    m "这里是最安全的地方。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3355
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_9b67a1b5:

    # a "Secure? How can you tell?"
    a "安全？你怎么知道？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3356
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_db9ce049:

    # m "Vantage point. It's deep within the pub, giving me a clear view of any incoming threats."
    m "视野好。在店面深处，让我能清楚看到所有可能的危险。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3357
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_a378bb57:

    # a "But wouldn't it be safer to sit closer to the exit for a quick escape?"
    a "但是坐在离出口近的地方，不是更方便逃跑吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3358
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_6f70e2a3:

    # m "If I can anticipate an attack, getting to the exit won't be a problem."
    m "如果我能预先看到攻击的话，赶到出口就根本不成问题。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3359
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_ebe784a9:

    # a "I see..."
    a "好吧……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3363
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_141e83a8:

    # a "Thanks for earlier. Without you, it could have gotten ugly."
    a "刚刚的事，谢谢你。没有你的话，可能会出现很糟糕的后果的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3364
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_4129cd82:

    # m "You're the one who took charge. We were just your support."
    m "掌握主动的人是你。我们只是在辅助你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3365
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_172c54e4:

    # a "I just wish I had your strength."
    a "真希望我能跟你一样厉害。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3368
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_f81388bc:

    # m "I don't get why people always want to be something. To become someone."
    m "我不明白为什么人人都想着变成别人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3369
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_a2b96008:

    # m "Physical strength isn't everything. You have your own strengths."
    m "肉体的强壮并不是一切。你有你自己的强项。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3370
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_76c4395b:

    # a "Well..."
    a "这个……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3371
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_851e2180:

    # m "Life has taught me that you can't be everything. We follow the paths set before us, unable to change our destiny."
    m "生活给我上了一课，让我知道自己没法无所不能。我们都只能走摆在我们面前的路，无法改变自己的命运。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3372
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_8c87a924:

    # m "To defy that... you'd have to be a deity."
    m "要想逆天改命……只有神才能做到。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3373
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_97597e53:

    # a "Where did you get that philosophy?"
    a "你这是从哪学来的？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3374
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_b62d92ca:

    # m "From someone very wise and very old."
    m "是一个非常有智慧，年龄非常大的人告诉我的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3375
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_0069f49f:

    # m "And trust me, my path is not one you'd want to walk, Aine Agnor."
    m "相信我，你是绝对不愿意走上我的道路的，艾妮·阿格诺。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3379
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_fe701db3:

    # a "... You're one of {i}them{/i}, right? What do you actually know about me?"
    a "……你是{i}他们{/i}的人，对吧？你对我的事情了解多少？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3380
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_66bd8beb:

    # m "Other than your thing with [mc]? Everything. You are Hera's daughter, after all."
    m "除了你和[mc!t]的事情之外，我全都知道。毕竟你是赫拉的女儿。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3381
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_bbc977e5:

    # a "I thought so."
    a "我想也是。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3384
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_ea0dc4e6:

    # m "Don't play ignorant, Aine. You know who I am."
