# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3388
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_5dc13e81:

    # a "Once you came, I think I got the gist of what happened."
    a "你来之后，我觉得我终于大概明白事情的全貌了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:3389
translate chinese crackinganaineopen_58e10ba8:

    # a "So... where are you hiding it?"
    a "所以……你把它藏在哪了？"

