translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_9354616b:

    # a "Right now, without [mc], I'm a lost cause. So... I'm prepared for whatever she'll do to me."
    a "现在，没有了[mc!t]，我完全不知所措。所以……不管她打算对我做什么，我都做好准备了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4252
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_ce363bb1:

    # a "It's just that... There are questions only she can answer. That's what I'm after."
    a "有一些问题……只有她能回答。所以我才这样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4253
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_66965b1a:

    # j "Understood. Do you have a meeting place in mind?"
    j "明白了。你打算在哪见面？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4254
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_47dd0d6d:

    # a "Yes, I know a place. I'll send you the details."
    a "嗯，我定好了一个地方。之后我把细节发给你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4276
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_9e533cf6:

    # a "*sighs* After all that bravado, I'm still shaking. Perhaps I shouldn't have done this..."
    a "*叹气* 刚刚逞强成那样……我现在还在发抖。或许我不该这么做的……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4280
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_87f360af:

    # a "Oh, hello there. You're still around, huh?"
    a "哦，你好啊。你居然还在？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4283
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_5c733834:

    # a "Come here, little one."
    a "过来，小家伙。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4286
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_2c1a9f35:

    # a "Aww, look at you. You haven't changed a bit over the years. Still as spry as ever."
    a "哈哈，瞧瞧你。过了这么多年，一点没变。还是那么有活力。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4289
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_cf95e2ca:

    # a "*giggles* What's your secret to eternal youth, huh?"
    a "*笑* 你永葆青春的秘诀是什么呢，嗯？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4292
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_6ba85c23:

    # a "*chuckles* Alright, then. Keep your secrets."
    a "*笑* 好吧，不想说就算了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4296
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_45da552c:

    # a "Yeah, it's just me today. I had a falling out with someone very dear, and... well, it's complicated."
    a "嗯，今天就我一个人。我跟一个非常重要的人吵架了，然后……唉，挺复杂的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4297
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c8205922:

    # a "But I'm planning to make things right. I'll bring him here next time, promise."
    a "但是我打算跟他和好。我下次会把他带来的，我保证。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4301
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_b86af0ee:

    # a "Look, I'd love your company, but someone who might not be so fond of you is coming. Best you stay safe."
    a "你能陪着我，我很高兴，但是一个可能不太喜欢你的人要来了。你还是先走吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4307
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_ce2fd2ad:

    # h "Ah, chasing after shadows and dreams, and where did it lead you? Right back to me."
    h "呵，追了那么久不切实际的梦想，看看你最终到了什么地方？终究还是回到了我面前。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4308
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_0c2eceb0:

    # a "Speak of the devil..."
    a "说来就来……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4312
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_1e7ab588:

    # h "Oh, there you are!"
    h "哦，是你啊！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4313
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_5adfbc34:

    # h "Here, kitty, kitty!"
    h "过来，小猫咪！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4320
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_bb8e4b4e_7:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4323
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_478e5131:

    # h "What's with that look?"
    h "这表情是什么意思？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4326
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_fb610148:

    # a "I thought you disliked cats."
    a "我以为你不喜欢猫。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4329
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_718a8266:

    # h "Because I never let you have pets?"
    h "因为我从来不让你养宠物？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4330
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_3d899212:

    # a "That's part of it, yes."
    a "有一部分这个原因。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4333
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_feb3fa8a:

    # h "Mm, you thought this, you thought that. You always were narrow-minded, Aine. You see one thing and think it's the whole picture."
    h "哼，以为来以为去的。你的眼界一直都太狭窄，艾妮。总是只看到冰山一角，就以为了解了全貌。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4334
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_bb8e4b4e_8:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4335
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_a6d1db84:

    # h "You see, cats, though fragile, have their charm. They can make you soft, showing your weakness."
    h "猫尽管脆弱，也有魅力。它们会让你温柔，让你暴露出弱点。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4336
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_7e2abc39:

    # h "They weren't what you needed for your development."
    h "培养你的过程中并不需要它们。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4339
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_615a54cd:

    # a "\"Development\". Oh, really?"
    a "“培养”。你认真的？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4340
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_7b765366:

    # a "Witnessing the horrors of torture, being forced into actions against my will, brainwashing, even physical harm."
    a "让我亲眼目睹可怕的折磨，逼着我做我不想做的事，给我洗脑，甚至动手打我。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4341
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_e82612d3:

    # a "That's what you call \"development\"?"
    a "这就是你的“培养”？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4342
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_b7ee2ec6_1:

    # h "Mm."
    h "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4345
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_cb6b9dc3:

    # h "Off you go now."
    h "你走吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4359
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_a248ba99:

    # a "... How did you know about that?"
    a "……你是怎么知道那个的？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4360
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_96de891f:

    # h "Who taught you in the first place?"
    h "是谁教你的？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4361
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_a171ee5d:

    # a "Dad."
    a "爸爸。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4362
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_e7fb30e6:

    # h "And I taught it to your father. Back when we were still dreaming of matters we'll never achieve now."
    h "你爸就是从我这里学的。那时候我们还在梦想着现在已不可能实现的事情。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4363
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_8e6210eb:

    # h "Although this land: its beauty was his dream, not mine."
    h "不过这个地方，这里的美，是他的梦想，不是我的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4364
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_33ed1077:

    # h "I sold it. But he saw its value, so he bought it back then brought it back to life."
    h "我把这里卖掉了。但他看到了这里的价值，又买了回来，让这里重新迸发生机。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4365
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_0cc46886:

    # h "How else would I have known where you and your young man were headed those days, hm?"
    h "不然那时候我怎么会知道你和你的小男友去了哪里呢，嗯？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4368
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_f6589737:

    # a "Ugh, I was so naive..."
    a "唉，我当时太天真了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4369
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_9eae23a0:

    # h "It seems you still are."
    h "我觉得你依然很天真。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4372
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_e4ce2d4a:

    # a "So you're the one maintaining this place?"
    a "所以现在是你在维护这里？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4373
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_63cc64f1:

    # h "Yes. I can't just abandon one of the precious things he's left behind."
    h "没错。这里是他留下的珍贵遗产，我没法抛弃。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4376
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_bb8e4b4e_9:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4384
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_7c9f26d7:

    # h "So, what brings you to me?"
    h "所以，你为什么来找我？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4385
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_fdec20b2:

    # a "Are you... not going to do anything to me?"
    a "你……不打算对我做什么吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4386
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_9f13360a:

    # h "I'd prefer you not waste my time; I haven't slept in ages."
    h "我希望你不要浪费我的时间；我很久没有好好睡觉了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4389
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_68971a0d:

    # a "Uhm..."
    a "呃……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4390
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_393901fc:

    # h "Don't give me the \"uhm\". It's not a word to start a conversation."
    h "不要“呃”。这个字不是用来开始对话的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4391
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_8244220c:

    # a "I just... want to know myself better."
    a "我只想……更了解我自己。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4396
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_3e58be5e:

    # h "*chuckles* That's what you called me here for? To find yourself? That's stupid."
    h "*笑* 你叫我来就是为了了解自己？真蠢。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4400
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_541b0523:

    # a "Stupid?! This goddamn \"growth\" you imposed on me is tearing my life apart!"
    a "蠢？！你强加给我的狗屁“成长”都要把我的生活给毁了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4401
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_2f73dd05:

    # a "Your \"lessons\" turned me into someone I don't even recognize!"
    a "你的“课程”把我变成了我根本不认识的人！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4402
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_b44b78a6:

    # a "Do you even realize the damage you've caused, the pain you've inflicted?"
    a "你难道不清楚你造成了多少伤害，让多少人觉得痛苦吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4403
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_36f9e5a3:

    # a "You've shaped me into a person I never wanted to be!"
    a "你把我变成了我从来不想变成的样子！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4404
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_5f715c91:

    # a "Because of you, I've pushed away the person I care about most!"
    a "都是因为你，我把我最在乎的人给推开了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4405
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_b0f89fd5:

    # a "And now, I'm left picking up the pieces of the life you've shattered!"
    a "事到如今，我只能慢慢拼凑被你打成碎片的人生！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4408
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_2fded262_2:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4414
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_58402c4d:

    # h "Your fiancé?"
    h "是你的未婚夫吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4415
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_f330ee74:

    # a "How did you..."
    a "你怎么会……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4416
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_d63187d5:

    # h "If that ring on your finger is not obvious enough, then I don't know what is."
    h "你指头上的戒指都快比天上的月亮还显眼了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4417
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_f7bc97a8:

    # a "W-well..."
    a "这-这个……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4418
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_9112a2b4:

    # h "Did you push him away?"
    h "你和他吵架了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4421
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_894e7159:

    # a "Yes..."
    a "是的……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4422
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_ef1bc497:

    # h "The worst thing I expected was to be giving romantic advice..."
    h "我最不想做的事就是提供感情建议……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4425
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_7a230639:

    # a "I don't need love advice! I need-"
    a "我不需要感情建议！我需要——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4426
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c883f4e2:

    # h "Let me guess. You're lost. Unsure which part of you is truly \"you\"."
    h "我猜猜啊。你迷失了。不知道哪部分才是真的“你”。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4429
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_691424b8:

    # a "Exactly... How do you know things before I even say them?"
    a "没错……为什么我没说你就知道了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4430
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_268816d5:

    # h "Because you are my daughter."
    h "因为你是我的女儿。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4431
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c036fce0:

    # h "... Sit down."
    h "……坐吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4435
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_d0f3a859:

    # h "*sighs* God, I can't believe I'm about to say this. It's not usually in my nature to be so... forthcoming."
    h "*叹气* 天啊，我居然要说这种话。我很不习惯这么……直率。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4436
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_f665f3eb:

    # a "Yeah, whatever."
    a "谁管你啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4439
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_2ccc0d76:

    # h "Listen, child. You're not lost. The person you are now: that's the real you. It's as simple as that."
    h "听着，孩子。你没有迷失。你现在的样子就是真实的你。就这么简单。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4440
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_220fdbb5:

    # a "But all those things you made me do, they changed me!"
    a "但是你逼我做的那些事，改变了我！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4441
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_72437c6b:

    # h "Changed? No. I merely brought out what was already there. Since your birth, I saw signs."
    h "改变？不对。我只是激发了你本来就有的东西。自打你出生，我就看到了各种迹象。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4442
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_f1468246:

    # a "Signs? What signs?"
    a "迹象？什么迹象？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4443
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_02626070:

    # h "Your determination, even as a child. The way you never backed down, even when you were overpowered."
    h "你在很小的时候，就充满决心。哪怕落了下风，也绝不退缩。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4444
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_29081440:

    # a "That was just me being stubborn."
    a "那只是我固执而已。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4445
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_bd41a332:

    # h "It was more than that. It was the ember of a strong will, a trait I knew could be honed."
    h "并非只是固执。那是钢铁般坚强的意志的种子，我知道那种特质需要我去磨炼。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4446
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_3a511ba7:

    # h "You see it as oppression, but I was drawing out your inherent strength."
    h "你觉得自己咄咄逼人，但那是被我培养出来的，你与生俱来的能力。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4447
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_0f27f385:

    # a "Strength? You call that strength?"
    a "能力？你管那个叫能力？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4448
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_8e8bab53:

    # h "Absolutely. That \"oppressive\" personality of yours? It's a sign of resilience, a will to survive and thrive."
    h "当然。你那“压迫性”的性格，是适应力的体现，代表着努力生存，茁壮成长的意志。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4449
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_8ff54ab4:

    # h "I saw that early on - your refusal to yield, your fierce independence, even when you were barely able to walk."
    h "我很早就发现了——你对让步的抵触，你对独立的渴求，甚至在你还不会走路的时候就开始了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4453
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_8c92483f:

    # a "But at what cost? It made me push away the people I care about."
    a "但代价是什么呢？这只让我和我关心的人渐行渐远。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4454
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_64e43ea4:

    # h "Having layers, Aine, is not a weakness. It makes you complex, interesting."
    h "艾妮，有层次并非弱点，反而让你更复杂，更有趣。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4455
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_0a04e2ab:

    # h "People without layers are dull, predictable, like robots."
    h "没有层次的人很无聊，一眼就能看穿，像机器人一样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4456
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_7ff9cacf:

    # a "But these goddamn layers are now tearing me apart!"
    a "可这些该死的层次快把我毁掉了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4457
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_63db2bba:

    # h "No, they're making you who you are. Strong, capable..."
    h "不，它们让你变成了现在的样子。强大，有能力……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4458
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_02540527:

    # h "... And yes, complicated."
    h "……还有复杂。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4461
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_9cba149f:

    # a "So you're saying all this... turmoil inside me is a good thing?"
    a "所以你的意思是我心里的这些……混乱，都是好事？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4462
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_e52b42b2:

    # h "It's a part of life. It means you're alive, not just existing."
    h "这是人生的一部分。这代表你活着，而非仅仅只是存在于这个世界上。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4463
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_a29893db:

    # a "Alive, but at the cost of my happiness."
    a "是活着，却失去了幸福。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4464
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_e545e02f:

    # h "Happiness is fleeting, Aine. Strength, resilience - these are lasting."
    h "幸福是会消退的，艾妮。力量，坚韧——这些品质才会永存。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4465
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c37fe4bd:

    # a "But I don't want to be just strong. I want to be happy, too!"
    a "可是我不想只是强大。我也想开心！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4466
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_6856edc4:

    # h "Strength can lead to happiness. You need to control it, not the other way around."
    h "力量可以带来幸福。你需要去控制力量，而不是被控制。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4467
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_f4b59a4f:

    # a "And if I can't?"
    a "要是我做不到呢？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4468
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_ac30bc6a:

    # h "You can. You're my daughter, after all. You have more power than you realize."
    h "你做得到。你是我的女儿。你的能力超乎你想象。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4471
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_f5bd2bae:

    # a "Power... is that all you see in me?"
    a "能力……在你眼里我的价值就只有这个吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4472
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_659983fd:

    # h "Power, potential, depth. You're not just one thing, Aine. You're a myriad of things."
    h "你身上有能力，有潜能，有深度。你并非只有一方面的才能，艾妮。你是无数品质的聚合。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4473
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_e92f615a:

    # a "And if I want to change? To be different?"
    a "那如果我想改变，想变得不一样呢？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4474
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_4f65f7fe:

    # h "Change if you must, I do not care. But remember: the core of who you are, that strength, it's a gift."
    h "如果有必要，那就变吧，我不在乎。但是记住：你的核心，那股力量，是你的天赋。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4477
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_fe58733e:

    # a "A gift that feels like a curse..."
    a "与其说是天赋，不如说是诅咒……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4478
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_13571a16:

    # h "Only if you let it be."
    h "只有你以为它是诅咒，它才会变成诅咒。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4479
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_d2892d5f:

    # h "Try embracing it, and maybe... just maybe... you'll see its true value."
    h "试着去拥抱它，说不定……只是说不定……你会看到它真正的价值。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4480
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_6db4e767:

    # a "It's not that simple after pushing away the most important person in my life..."
    a "我刚因为这个疏远了我人生中最重要的人，哪有那么容易……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4481
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_3e5095f2:

    # h "Well, nothing worth having ever is. But you're capable of more than you give yourself credit for."
    h "有价值的事物从来都不容易。但是你的能力要比你自认为的更强。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4482
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_321ad14a:

    # a "I'm not sure if I can see it your way."
    a "我可能没法从你的视角看问题。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4483
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_644904f2:

    # a "No, I'm sure I never will. I still refuse to abide by your laws."
    a "不，我肯定永远都做不到。我依然拒绝按你的规则来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4484
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_99496a9f:

    # h "Who knows? In time, you might."
    h "谁知道呢？假以时日，说不定你就愿意了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4485
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_02faefe5:

    # h "For now, just remember that you're not solely what you feel or have been through."
    h "现在，只需要记住你并非只由你的情感和经历过的事所定义。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4486
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_e1399179:

    # h "You're a culmination of all your experiences, the good and the bad."
    h "你是你所有的经历的总和，无论好坏。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4489
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_9d84f471:

    # a "... So you admit that the things you did to me were {i}bad{/i}, then?"
    a "……你这是承认你对我做的事是坏的了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4490
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_27e7a10c:

    # h "*chuckles* Good or bad, it was necessary parenting. Whether you accept that or do not, I couldn't care less."
    h "*笑* 不管是好是坏，都是对你必要的养育。至于你接不接受，我根本不在乎。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4491
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_5ca830a0:

    # a "How can you dismiss the pain you caused as simply \"parenting\"?"
    a "你怎么能轻飘飘一句“养育”就把你造成的痛苦一笔带过？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4492
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_104a99a0:

    # h "Again, you're looking at it too narrowly, Aine. Life isn't just about what hurts us."
    h "又来了，你还是看得太窄，艾妮。生活里并非只有你受过的伤。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4495
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_4012b8f3:

    # a "But the pain you caused was real. How can you overlook that?"
    a "可是你引发的痛苦是实际存在过的。你怎么能忽视？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4496
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_4418fa88:

    # h "It's not overlooking. It's seeing beyond the immediate. I was preparing you for an unkind world."
    h "不是忽视。而是看得更远。我是在让你为残忍的世界做好准备。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4497
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_436d8de1:

    # a "Preparation? There are gentler ways to teach someone about this world!"
    a "准备？让人理解这个世界，当然有更温柔的方式啊！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4498
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_59c242d1:

    # h "Perhaps, but would gentler ways have made you as strong as you are now?"
    h "或许吧，但那些更温柔的方式会让你像现在这样强大吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4501
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_487a66ce:

    # a "I didn't need to be this \"strong\" at the cost of my happiness."
    a "我根本不需要以我的幸福为代价，变得这么强。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4502
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_56837642:

    # h "Like I said, happiness can be temporary. The strength I shaped in you is enduring."
    h "我说过了，幸福是转瞬即逝的。我帮你获得的力量会永远留下来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4503
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_cbd46388:

    # a "Is enduring strength worth the cost of constant suffering?"
    a "这永存的力量值得让我永远受苦吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4504
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_07d45f1c:

    # h "Suffering is a part of life. It shapes us, challenges us."
    h "苦难是人生的一部分。它能塑造我们，给我们带来挑战。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4505
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_aab26499:

    # a "But it shouldn't define us. I don't want my life defined by suffering."
    a "但它不应该定义我们。我不想让我的人生被苦难定义。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4506
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_4f6295dc:

    # h "Then let it define your resilience. You've survived, haven't you?"
    h "那就让它定义你的坚韧不拔。你不是一直撑到了现在吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4507
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_bb8e4b4e_10:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4511
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_fe9e06eb:

    # h "I was informed you did something a week ago. Did that really happen?"
    h "我听说你一个星期以前干了件大事。是真的吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4512
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_7245af7e:

    # a "Wait, who told you?"
    a "等等，谁告诉你的？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4513
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_3b284479:

    # h "Your man informed Jess, and the news came to me."
    h "你的男人告诉了婕斯，然后我就知道了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4517
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_228808fc:

    # a "Oh my god..."
    a "我的天啊……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4518
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_d59bf5ab:

    # h "Bold move, but it worked, nonetheless."
    h "很大胆的举动，但终归是起效了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4521
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_7fc2bbaf:

    # h "Without that strength I gave you, would you have been able to save that person's life?"
    h "如果没有我给你的这个能力，你还能救下那个人的命吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4522
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_bb8e4b4e_11:

    # a "..."
    a "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4525
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_4129cd82:

    # m "You're the one who took charge. We were just your support."
    m "掌握主动的人是你。我们只是在辅助你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4531
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_848cdad5:

    # a "No..."
    a "不能……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4534
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_6e5e830a:

    # h "You've always seen the world through a narrow lens, influenced by our family."
    h "你受到我们家的影响，一直在用狭隘的目光看世界。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4535
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_55d4be3d:

    # h "I tried to broaden your perspective, yet you resist the possibilities."
    h "我想拓宽你的视野，你却一直抵抗。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4536
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_aff2653e:

    # h "Open your eyes, Aine. There's no need to choose one identity. Embrace all facets of yourself."
    h "睁开眼睛，艾妮。没有必要只选择一种身份。接受你的所有部分。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4537
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_ba0770a7:

    # h "You've always despised the lamest things. So, what's with the tears now? I can't quite grasp what you're getting so emotional about."
    h "你一直都鄙视无聊的事。那你现在还哭什么？我不理解你有什么可伤心的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4545
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_dc189c5e:

    # h "Ah, it seems your escort is here. Our time is up."
    h "啊，看来来接你的人到了。就到这里吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4546
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_b772d5f4:

    # a "Escort?"
    a "接我？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4547
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_0831949d:

    # h "I can't let you wander alone at this hour, can I?"
    h "这么晚了，我还能让你一个人回去吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4551
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_705efbf4:

    # a "Mom, wait!"
    a "妈妈，等一下！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4552
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_227eb657:

    # h "Yes?"
    h "怎么了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4555
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_66a0d7d7:

    # a "After everything I've done for you..."
    a "我为你做了这么多……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4556
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c54e2135:

    # a "Were you... ever proud of me?"
    a "你有……以我为傲吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4559
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_2fded262_3:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4562
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_6a8e970e:

    # a "Mnh..."
    a "嗯……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4563
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_5c95de68:

    # h "You still love that, I see... I'm glad."
    h "你还是喜欢这样……我很高兴。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4566
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_d998e3a9:

    # h "Farewell, Aine..."
    h "再见，艾妮……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4575
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4578
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_a7e48f3c:

    # h "Hold on."
    h "等等。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4582
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_2331bbb9:

    # h "Oh, one more thing."
    h "哦，还有一件事。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4583
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_cf9e6335:

    # a "Yes...?"
    a "什么……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4588
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_e643de1b:

    # mc "Mmp!"
    mc "唔！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4595
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_a0c49ecb:

    # a "You..."
    a "你……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4599
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c1f1006a:

    # h "Be fucking decisive."
    h "别他妈扭扭捏捏的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4604
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_6274cfdd:

    # a "You... BITCH!"
    a "你……臭婊子！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4605
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c57a6bbe:

    # h "See? That's more like it."
    h "看吧？这样才像话。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4606
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_1b5bec66:

    # a "I will never become like you! Remember that!"
    a "我绝对不会变得和你一样！给我记住！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4607
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c31bf144:

    # h "Mm, at this point, you're already a cheap imitation of me!"
    h "呵，到了现在，你已经算是山寨版的我了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4608
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_289c0137:

    # a "I may have the same personality as you, but I swear, I will never become a monster!"
    a "我或许跟你有一样的性格，但是我发誓，我永远不会变成怪物！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4612
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_14a34921:

    # h "A fine kisser. Tell your [landlady] I said \"Hi\"."
    h "吻技不错。替我跟你[landlady!t]打个招呼。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4613
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_306e5790:

    # mc "Can you stop putting on a brave face and talk to your daughter like a real mother?"
    mc "你能不能别总装出一幅很厉害的样子，像个真正的母亲一样和你的女儿聊聊不好吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4614
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_09eb5cc2:

    # h "What do you think I just did? That was more than enough..."
    h "你觉得我刚刚是在干嘛？那样就已经足够了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4615
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c6348265:

    # mc "*chuckles* More than enough..."
    mc "*笑* 已经足够了啊……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4619
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_4da3839d:

    # h "Embrace it, Aine!"
    h "接受吧，艾妮！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4624
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_74be38f3:

    # h "Tell your [landlady] I said \"Hi\"."
    h "替我跟你[landlady!t]打个招呼。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4625
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4629
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_1b5bec66_1:

    # a "I will never become like you! Remember that!"
    a "我绝对不会变得和你一样！给我记住！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4630
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c31bf144_1:

    # h "Mm, at this point, you're already a cheap imitation of me!"
    h "呵，到了现在，你已经算是山寨版的我了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4631
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_289c0137_1:

    # a "I may have the same personality as you, but I swear, I will never become a monster!"
    a "我或许跟你有一样的性格，但是我发誓，我永远不会变成怪物！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4635
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_306e5790_1:

    # mc "Can you stop putting on a brave face and talk to your daughter like a real mother?"
    mc "你能不能别总装出一幅很厉害的样子，像个真正的母亲一样和你的女儿聊聊不好吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4636
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_09eb5cc2_1:

    # h "What do you think I just did? That was more than enough..."
    h "你觉得我刚刚是在干嘛？那样就已经足够了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4637
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c6348265_1:

    # mc "*chuckles* More than enough..."
    mc "*笑* 已经足够了啊……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4641
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_4da3839d_1:

    # h "Embrace it, Aine!"
    h "接受吧，艾妮！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4646
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_84a9c1e4:

    # j "Shall we?"
    j "走吧？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4647
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_b7ee2ec6_2:

    # h "Mm."
    h "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4658
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_ff746710:

    # h "Ow, ow, ow!"
    h "啊，啊，啊！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4661
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_5803949d:

    # ri "Hey, are you alright?"
    ri "你没事吧？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4662
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_b3e21dbd:

    # h "Yes, it's just... she's quite active in there..."
    h "没事，就是……她在里面很活跃……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4665
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_11ead689:

    # ri "Eager to see the world, aren't you, my dearest?"
    ri "是不是想早点看见这个世界呀，小宝贝？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4666
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_d9544dc7:

    # ri "But let's not be too hasty. We want you just perfect, not premature like someone we know."
    ri "但是别太着急。我们想让你的一切都完美，可不能跟某人一样，假装成熟。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4669
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_2fded262_4:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4670
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_dede6ab5:

    # ri "I'm just joking..."
    ri "我开个玩笑……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4673
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_f37da28e:

    # h "*chuckles* She's going to be the best."
    h "*笑* 她一定会是最棒的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4676
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_ed74790b:

    # ri "You know, I've been giving it much thought... What about the name Aine?"
    ri "我已经想了很久了……你觉得艾妮这个名字怎么样？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4677
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c6527865:

    # h "Aine?"
    h "艾妮？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4678
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_dcc199c4:

    # ri "Yeah, Aine. Like the goddess - strong, radiant, a reflection of her mother's beauty and strength."
    ri "对，艾妮。这是女神的名字——强大，闪耀，和她妈妈一样漂亮，能干。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4679
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_775bf87f:

    # h "Aine... I love it, Richard. It's just right."
    h "艾妮……我喜欢这名字，理查德。刚刚好。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4682
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_ed8e4caa:

    # ri "I dream of her being as formidable as you, Hera. Able to stand tall against all odds."
    ri "我希望她能和你一样强大，赫拉。可以对抗所有的困难。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4683
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_1dce2f0f:

    # h "And she will. We'll guide her together."
    h "她可以的。我们一起指引她。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4684
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_efcc855b:

    # ri "She'll inherit the best from us. Your indomitable spirit and, hopefully, some of my charm and wit."
    ri "她会继承我们身上最好的部分。比如你百折不挠的精神，还有，嗯，希望还有我的一些魅力和智慧吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4685
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_419edad0:

    # h "Oh, she definitely will, with you as her father."
    h "有你这样的爸爸，那是当然。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4686
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_e5dc55b7:

    # ri "It's a team effort, after all. We're in this together, every step of the way."
    ri "毕竟，这是两个人的功劳嘛。我们在每一个阶段都是一起的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4692
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_886e2baf:

    # h "Always together."
    h "永远在一起。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4698
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_485e69c0:

    # h "{i}And now, Richard, I've finally let our daughter go..."
    h "{i}理查德，就在刚刚，我终于放手了……我们的女儿……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4699
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_978ac59d:

    # h "{i}On those lonely nights, those difficult days of conflict, you were always there with me."
    h "{i}在那些孤独的夜里，那些心烦意乱的日子里，你一直都陪着我。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4700
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_121a6a69:

    # h "{i}Your presence gave me the strength to keep going."
    h "{i}你的存在给了我继续前行的力量。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4701
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_05a89253:

    # h "{i}But now that you're gone, I wonder... are you happy where you are?"
    h "{i}可是现在你已经不在了，我想知道……你在那里过得开心吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4702
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_12e35d16:

    # h "{i}Memories of you often come back and always bring tears."
    h "{i}有关你的记忆总是带来泪水。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4703
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_fbc7c0b5:

    # h "{i}Without you and our daughters..."
    h "{i}没有你和我们的两个女儿……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4704
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_b0fa74da:

    # h "{i}... I feel so alone."
    h "{i}……我好孤单。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4708
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_7bc7f045:

    # h "Ow!"
    h "啊！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4711
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_603c5785:

    # h "Shit! SHIT!"
    h "操！妈的！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4712
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_d4fcfff7:

    # h "Goddamn it, Jess! What was that for?!"
    h "他妈的，婕斯！你干嘛啊？！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4715
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_bd7d0f33:

    # j "I'm still here."
    j "还有我在。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4718
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_2fded262_5:

    # h "..."
    h "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4722
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_163832fd:

    # j "Don't worry, you can cry now..."
    j "没事，你可以哭了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4725
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_fa9c7062:

    # h "{i}Richard, for our daughter, I've given everything I had."
    h "{i}理查德，为了我们的女儿，我已付出了我的一切。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4726
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_ea80ec35:

    # h "{i}I can only hope... I've lived up to your dream and nurtured Aine into the strong woman you envisioned."
    h "{i}我只希望……我达成了你的梦想，把艾妮养育成了你构想的那种坚强的女人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4727
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_01dfe6e6:

    # h "{i}Tell me, have I done enough? Have I been the mother you always believed I could be...?"
    h "{i}请告诉我，我做得足够了吗？我有成为你认为我能成为的那种母亲吗……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4728
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c21e5b0f:

    # h "{i}If not, then, please forgive me. I'll make it up to you when we see each other again."
    h "{i}如果没有，那请你原谅我吧。等我们再次相见的时候，我会补偿你的……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4731
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_fa0dbc48:

    # j "I'm proud of you, sis"
    j "你是我的骄傲，姐姐。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4732
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_202f7e09:

    # h "Stop it."
    h "得了吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4733
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_a1a410d1:

    # j "Hey, thanks for the vote of confidence."
    j "多谢你对我的信任啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4734
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_7a418977:

    # h "Can it, Jess."
    h "少来，婕斯。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4735
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_d1f0737c:

    # j "Alright, alright."
    j "好吧好吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4736
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_85408796:

    # h "Where's your necklace? Did you lose it? I can buy you a differnet one."
    h "你的项链呢？丢了吗？我可以给你买条不一样的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4737
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_27a30b96:

    # j "Nah, it just didn't match today's look."
    j "没有，只是跟我今天的衣服不搭。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4738
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_c3deed2e:

    # h "How about giving the hair dye a rest? You're still rebelling against a dead person."
    h "头发干脆别继续染了如何？人都已经死了，你还在跟他对着干啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4739
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_214a5499:

    # j "I'm used to it by now. This color's become part of my signature."
    j "我已经习惯了。这个颜色都变成我的特征了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4740
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_d8afce94:

    # h "Then at least try to act your age around me. Your childish antics makes me sick."
    h "那至少在我身边的时候做点跟你的年龄相符的事吧。你那些幼稚的行为让我恶心。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4741
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_254bfa5d:

    # j "Love ya, sis."
    j "爱你哦，老姐。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4742
translate chinese ainepubtensionbuildup_bfdaaa78:

    # h "Urrgghh...!"
    h "呕呕……！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4750
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a15d334c:

    # mc "Hey..."
    mc "嗨……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4751
translate chinese aineonsteroids_614d0543:

    # "You speak softly, stepping closer to her."
    "你轻轻地说，慢慢地靠近她。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4754
translate chinese aineonsteroids_6c5a0458:

    # a "[mc]... why did you come for me?"
    a "[mc!t]……你为什么来找我？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4755
translate chinese aineonsteroids_873fbe01:

    # mc "To take you home."
    mc "带你回家。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4758
translate chinese aineonsteroids_28cba2e3:

    # a "You don't have to obey her, especially not for my sake!"
    a "你不用听她的话，特别是不用为了我听她的！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4759
translate chinese aineonsteroids_546eee65:

    # mc "It's not about her, Aine! I'm here because I care about you!"
    mc "跟她没有关系，艾妮！我来是因为我在乎你！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4760
translate chinese aineonsteroids_490a6f8d:

    # a "I don't need you to look after me!"
    a "我不需要你照顾我！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4763
translate chinese aineonsteroids_f1ecd890:

    # mc "Then why do you look so lost? I'm just trying to be here for you, Aine!"
    mc "那你为什么一幅迷失了方向的样子？我只是想陪在你身边，艾妮！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4764
translate chinese aineonsteroids_b6d4dd4e:

    # a "I never asked for you to be here!"
    a "我从来没有要求你陪我过！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4767
translate chinese aineonsteroids_16c14115:

    # "You take another step forward, further closing the distance."
    "你又向前走了一步，进一步缩短距离。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4768
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5e489262:

    # mc "Do you know what your problem is? You push people away when you're scared!"
    mc "你知道你的毛病在哪吗？你一害怕，就会把别人推开！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4771
translate chinese aineonsteroids_206dc4a1:

    # "Aine's jaw tightens at your words as a surge of anger courses through her veins."
    "你的话让艾妮的下巴紧绷，愤怒的情绪在她的体内涌动。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4775
translate chinese aineonsteroids_3f8ce35e:

    # a "I'm not scared!"
    a "我没有怕！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4776
translate chinese aineonsteroids_56f41838:

    # mc "Then why did you run away? Why did you push me away?"
    mc "那你为什么要逃跑？为什么要推开我？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4777
translate chinese aineonsteroids_886d6a1b:

    # a "I-I don't know, okay?! I just..."
    a "我-我不知道，行了吧？！我就是……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4781
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2a1c4e90:

    # "Before Aine can finish her words, your hand shoots out and grabs her waist, pulling her roughly towards you."
    "没等艾妮说完，你的手已经伸出，搂住她的腰，将她拉向你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4782
translate chinese aineonsteroids_62f99036:

    # "Your bodies collide as Aine lets out a small gasp."
    "你们的身体碰撞在一起，艾妮轻轻发出了惊讶的声音。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4783
translate chinese aineonsteroids_150c774b:

    # "You whisper, your breath hot against her ear."
    "你在她耳边低声说道。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4786
translate chinese aineonsteroids_58d214ca:

    # mc "Maybe you were scared of admitting just how much you need me..."
    mc "或许你只是害怕承认你非常需要我……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4787
translate chinese aineonsteroids_bfb3d4d9:

    # "Aine's heart pounds in her chest as she stares up at you, her anger slowly giving way to desire."
    "艾妮看向你，心跳不断加快，愤怒慢慢变成了欲望。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4788
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e2267e30:

    # "Both of you are acutely aware that the heat, the tension that had been building, is now threatening to consume you both."
    "你们两个都清楚地意识到，不断积蓄的热情与渴望即将吞噬你们。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4796
translate chinese aineonsteroids_4774a43a:

    # "Your lips crash against hers in a desperate kiss as you stumble into the room, slamming the door shut behind you."
    "你踏进房间，狠狠关上身后的门，然后和她热烈地拥吻起来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4797
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e41baaa3:

    # "With a grunt of determination, you sweep Aine off her feet and carry her towards the wall."
    "你下定决心，低吼一声，把艾妮抱了起来，走向墙边。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4798
translate chinese aineonsteroids_b176544e:

    # "She clings to you instinctively as the world spins around her - one hand gripping at your shirt while the other entwines itself in your hair."
    "世界在她周围旋转，让她本能地抱紧了你——一只手抓着你的衣服，另一只手与你的头发纠缠在一起。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4802
translate chinese aineonsteroids_77f8346d:

    # a "Aahh~!"
    a "啊啊~！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4803
translate chinese aineonsteroids_f4e83171:

    # "Aine's back hits the wall with a thud, causing her to let out a small yelp."
    "艾妮的背撞到墙上，发出咚的一声，让她小声叫了出来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4804
translate chinese aineonsteroids_00b169aa:

    # "You press yourself against her, pinning her in place."
    "你把自己的重量压向她，把她固定住。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4807
translate chinese aineonsteroids_12b12e1a:

    # "You can feel the heat radiating off of each other's bodies as you breathe hot air into each other's mouths."
    "你们的嘴中互相发出温热的吐息，体温也在互相传递。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4808
translate chinese aineonsteroids_44781695:

    # "Every touch - from your rough hands on her skin to how your lips move ravenously against hers - sends electricity up both your spines."
    "每一次触摸——不管是你粗糙的手掠过她的皮肤，还是你的嘴唇肆意蹂躏她的嘴唇——都有着如同触电一般的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4809
translate chinese aineonsteroids_45c98be6:

    # "You grind your hips, your fully erect length pressing against her."
    "你扭动屁股，让完全勃起的下体摩擦着她。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4810
translate chinese aineonsteroids_1bc367fd:

    # "Even through the layers of fabric, Aine feels your pulsating rod."
    "尽管中间有衣物的阻隔，艾妮还是感觉到了你跳动着的肉棒。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4811
translate chinese aineonsteroids_8751876c:

    # a "Mmh..."
    a "嗯……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4812
translate chinese aineonsteroids_479241a0:

    # "She utters a subdued moan in response."
    "她轻声发出呻吟作为回应。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4813
translate chinese aineonsteroids_cf6c809d:

    # "Aine becomes further lost in the sensation, overwhelmed by how you feel pressed on her torso."
    "艾妮更加沉醉于情欲之中，你压在她身上的感觉让她意乱神迷。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4814
translate chinese aineonsteroids_44796544:

    # "You can feel the hunger growing in your soul as well - a hunger that will only be satisfied by finally claiming Aine completely as yours."
    "你感到自己灵魂深处的饥渴也越来越膨胀——这种饥渴只有把艾妮完全据为己有之后才能满足。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4815
translate chinese aineonsteroids_f3b8ca2c:

    # "However..."
    "然而……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4818
translate chinese aineonsteroids_acda9f4c:

    # a "Mmp!"
    a "唔！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4822
translate chinese aineonsteroids_70834601:

    # "Aine pushes you back with all her might."
    "艾妮用尽全身力气把你推开了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4823
translate chinese aineonsteroids_d66759a7:

    # "As you fall back, you see her eyes reflecting a brewing storm of feelings."
    "你往后退去，看到她的眼神中蕴含着许多复杂的感情。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4824
translate chinese aineonsteroids_7a3a1303:

    # "You find yourself sitting on the edge of the bed once you reorient yourself."
    "你调整好姿态，坐在床边。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4827
translate chinese aineonsteroids_4e65bedb:

    # mc "Tsk! Why can't you just...!"
    mc "啧！你怎么就不能……！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4831
translate chinese aineonsteroids_dc53a639:

    # "Regaining your composure, you purposefully grab her hand."
    "你重新镇定下来，抓住她的手。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4835
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5e0a7311:

    # "With a newfound resolve, you pin her down."
    "你再次下定决心，将她压倒。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4836
translate chinese aineonsteroids_6182bd71:

    # mc "Why can't you just get your head right and talk to me properly!"
    mc "你怎么就不能想清楚，好好跟我聊聊呢！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4839
translate chinese aineonsteroids_7c9aaac7:

    # a "... *hics*"
    a "…… *抽泣*"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4842
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2523fd15:

    # a "I...I'm sorry~!"
    a "对……对不起！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4843
translate chinese aineonsteroids_fedefec0:

    # mc "You don't need to apologize! All I wanted was for you to face me; I've been waiting!"
    mc "没有必要道歉！我只想让你面对我；我等了好久！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4846
translate chinese aineonsteroids_f623c6db:

    # a "What do you think I just did~?!"
    a "你觉得我之前都在做什么呀？！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4847
translate chinese aineonsteroids_9cbaa93e:

    # a "I love you, [mc]! I never wanted to hurt you! I didn't want you to go away!"
    a "我爱你，[mc!t]！我从来都没想过要伤害你！我不想让你走！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4848
translate chinese aineonsteroids_c98f2ac5:

    # a "So I thought I'd risk it and talk to my mother to find out who I really was! So I could face you as a better version of myself!"
    a "所以我想冒个险，去和我妈妈谈谈，搞清楚我到底是谁！这样我才能以更好的面貌面对你！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4849
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a31f8a74:

    # a "Yet the only thing she told me was to accept it?! How is that supposed to make me better?!"
    a "可是她却只告诉我，让我接受？！那怎么可能会让我变得更好呢？！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4852
translate chinese aineonsteroids_c29a595b:

    # a "*crying* I'm scared of myself, [mc]! I don't want any of this~! I don't want to lose you~!"
    a "*大哭* 我害怕我自己，[mc!t]！我一点也不想这样！我不想失去你！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4853
translate chinese aineonsteroids_825980aa:

    # yt "She's shaking... Even worse than last time."
    yt "她在发抖……比上次还严重。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4854
translate chinese aineonsteroids_12b15899:

    # yt "Her fear is there. It's real..."
    yt "她真的很害怕……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4857
translate chinese aineonsteroids_9aae017e:

    # mc "You won't lose me, Aine. But we can't let fear dictate our actions. My fear turned into anger that day, and I regret that."
    mc "你不会失去我的，艾妮。但是我们的行为不能被恐惧左右。那天我的恐惧就变成了愤怒，我很后悔。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4858
translate chinese aineonsteroids_38845c69:

    # a "But my fear turns into this urge to control, to push others away for protection."
    a "但是我的恐惧变成了想要控制一切的冲动，想为了保护，把别人都赶走。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4859
translate chinese aineonsteroids_15b2d29e:

    # mc "Who are you trying to protect? Me, or yourself?"
    mc "你想保护谁？我，还是你自己？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4860
translate chinese aineonsteroids_28a2b5ce:

    # a "I don't know, [mc]. After speaking with Mom, everything's... more complicated."
    a "我不知道，[mc!t]。在和妈妈聊过之后，一切……都更复杂了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4861
translate chinese aineonsteroids_38c05197:

    # mc "Look, I get it, okay? But shutting me out wasn't the solution."
    mc "好，我明白了。但是拒绝跟我沟通是没法解决问题的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4862
translate chinese aineonsteroids_1cda65fd:

    # mc "I just don't want us to become people we're not, Aine. That's all."
    mc "我只是不想让我们变成我们不该是的样子，艾妮。仅此而已。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4863
translate chinese aineonsteroids_3ebb5c6b:

    # a "But what if that's part of who I am, [mc]?"
    a "可如果那就是我的一部分呢，[mc!t]？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4864
translate chinese aineonsteroids_fd9c0888:

    # a "What if she's right, and I've just been fighting it?"
    a "有没有可能她是对的，我只是一直在否认？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4867
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e00d8102:

    # mc "You know, your other side was never a secret, especially to me. I experienced it firsthand."
    mc "你的另一面从来都不是什么秘密，我深有体会。因为我亲身经历过。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4868
translate chinese aineonsteroids_80358659:

    # mc "Still, there's this question in my head that I've never really pondered until now: Why did I ever accept you back into my life?"
    mc "但是，我心里还是有一个问题，直到现在我才开始考虑：为什么我会愿意再让你进入我的生活呢？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4869
translate chinese aineonsteroids_8e9861ed:

    # mc "And do you know why? Because I saw more in you than just that side."
    mc "你知道为什么吗？是因为我不止看到了你的那一面。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4870
translate chinese aineonsteroids_c469ee78:

    # mc "I saw someone brave, someone trying to overcome her shadows."
    mc "我看到了一个勇敢的人，一个想要战胜自己的阴影的人。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4871
translate chinese aineonsteroids_70aac15c:

    # mc "I saw a girl who cares deeply about the people in her life, who will do anything to lead them towards happiness."
    mc "我看到了一个非常在乎身边的人，会用尽办法让其他人幸福的女生。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4872
translate chinese aineonsteroids_48416eba:

    # mc "I saw a girl who would move heaven and hell if it meant that she would make life easier for the people she loves."
    mc "我看到了一个只要能让爱的人过得更好，赴汤蹈火在所不辞的女生。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:4875
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2f99604f:

