# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5640
translate chinese aineonsteroids_6a12c6e8:

    # f "Did I really tell her to be careful...?"
    f "我真的有必要让她小心吗……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5643
translate chinese aineonsteroids_8f94df6b:

    # f "*yawn*"
    f "*打哈欠*"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5646
translate chinese aineonsteroids_755b17e0:

    # f "Man, I'm really out of it... Hope I don't zonk out before dinner..."
    f "唉，累死了……希望晚饭之前不要睡着啊……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5655
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5658
translate chinese aineonsteroids_0599a445:

    # m "Hey."
    m "嗨。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5662
translate chinese aineonsteroids_48ecc70c:

    # mc "JESUS FUCKING CHRIST ON A MOTORBIKE!!!"
    mc "{b}我骑摩托的老天爷啊！！！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5663
translate chinese aineonsteroids_8c1b4414:

    # m "'Sup?"
    m "你好？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5666
translate chinese aineonsteroids_612b43aa:

    # mc "What are you doing here?!"
    mc "你怎么来了？！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5667
translate chinese aineonsteroids_4aa68240:

    # m "To make sure you're good."
    m "来确认你的安危。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5670
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5673
translate chinese aineonsteroids_615d675a:

    # mc "Is that really all you came here for?"
    mc "真的是因为这个吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5674
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5675
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e7674d94:

    # mc "Hey, don't even think about it. You always look away from me when you're about to deny something."
    mc "少来这套。你每次想否认的时候都会把视线挪开。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5684
translate chinese aineonsteroids_d816a88e:

    # m "I just... I graduated. And now I don't really have anything to keep me busy."
    m "我就是……我毕业了。所以现在没有事情可以做。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5685
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a0762b8a:

    # m "It's... kind of uncomfortable not having you around."
    m "没有你在身边……很不舒服。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5686
translate chinese aineonsteroids_48d0b19f:

    # mc "Wait, you're feeling uncomfortable without me? That's... new."
    mc "啊？没有我陪着你会不舒服？这还是……头一回听说。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5687
translate chinese aineonsteroids_15b80cc1:

    # m "Don't make it weird. It's just that I'm used to having a purpose. Guarding you, college... and now it's all just... empty."
    m "别说得那么奇怪。只是我习惯了有目的地活着。比如保护你，去上学……但现在却……一片空白。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5688
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2366ede4:

    # mc "I get it. It's a big change."
    mc "我明白。这变化是很大。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5689
translate chinese aineonsteroids_7028cefa:

    # mc "But you know, there's a whole world out there. You can do anything."
    mc "但是世界这么大，你想做什么都可以啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5690
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ff572723:

    # m "It's not that simple. After moving here, I've spent so long just being your bodyguard and a student."
    m "没那么简单。搬过来之后，我作为你的保镖和一名学生过了很久。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5691
translate chinese aineonsteroids_17e000de:

    # m "I don't even know what \"anything\" could be for me."
    m "我根本都不知道“做什么都可以”代表着什么意思。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5694
translate chinese aineonsteroids_578ae19f:

    # mc "Well, why not start by exploring what you like? There must be things you're interested in."
    mc "嗯，那就从找到你喜欢的东西开始呗？你肯定会有感兴趣的东西吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5695
translate chinese aineonsteroids_37974d5b:

    # m "I guess... I haven't really thought about it. I've always been focused on things specifically assigned to me."
    m "可能吧……我没有怎么想过。我一直都只关注被分配给我的任务。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5696
translate chinese aineonsteroids_78b6c79f:

    # mc "Look, Moon, you've got skills, and not just in bodyguard-ing. There's more to you than just that."
    mc "听我说，月，你有很多本领，不止是当保镖这一方面。你并非局限于此。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5697
translate chinese aineonsteroids_bcf801dc:

    # mc "I know you're committed to your duty, but isn't it time to explore what else life has for you? You've been at a crossroads since graduation, haven't you?"
    mc "我知道你很看重自己的使命，但现在不正是探索人生路的好机会吗？在毕业之后，就是人生的十字路口嘛。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5698
translate chinese aineonsteroids_fe130fd8:

    # m "Honestly, I'm not sure. When you're not around, I feel... off, unsettled. Like something's missing, and it leaves me restless."
    m "说实话，我搞不明白。你一不在身边，我就觉得……不对劲，不安心。就好像缺了什么东西一样，让我坐立不安。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5701
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5702
translate chinese aineonsteroids_8b56d182:

    # yt "She's not wrong. I can feel it too: this subtle bond that's formed between us."
    yt "她说得对。我也能感觉到。我们之间有一层微妙的联系。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5703
translate chinese aineonsteroids_79a55d60:

    # yt "Sure, her sudden appearance startled me, but there was also this inexplicable relief that washed over me the moment I saw her."
    yt "当然，她突然出现吓到了我，可当我看到她的时候，却也莫名其妙地感觉到了安心。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5704
translate chinese aineonsteroids_d28ffcaf:

    # yt "When did this connection actually start? It's hard to pinpoint. But it definitely has strengthened since we've become much closer."
    yt "这种联系是什么时候开始的？很难确定。但在我们变得亲密之后，绝对是变强了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5705
translate chinese aineonsteroids_d72def93:

    # yt "It's unlike anything I've felt before, and I can't quite put my finger on it."
    yt "这和我以前所有的感觉都不一样。我也暂时弄不明白。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5708
translate chinese aineonsteroids_4fe33a94:

    # mc "Give me a little time to finish up here. Then we'll head home together, okay?"
    mc "等我一下，我收个尾。之后我们一起回家，好吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5709
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e9260ce0:

    # m "I'm not going anywhere without you. I'll wait."
    m "没有你，我哪也不去。我会等着你的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5716
translate chinese aineonsteroids_092eb17b:

    # "After dinner..."
    "晚饭之后……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5728
translate chinese aineonsteroids_706b3feb:

    # mc "This has been wrestling in my mind for a while. Now seems like the right time to talk about it."
    mc "我已经想了很久了。现在似乎正是说出来的机会。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5729
translate chinese aineonsteroids_487a1850:

    # m "Hm?"
    m "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5730
translate chinese aineonsteroids_39cc9d54:

    # mc "Man... I don't even know how to explain it..."
    mc "唉……该怎么解释呢……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5733
translate chinese aineonsteroids_00686d04:

    # m "Do you want me to-"
    m "你是不是想让我——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5737
translate chinese aineonsteroids_6b7c2b49:

    # mc "Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hold on!"
    mc "哎哎哎！停！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5738
translate chinese aineonsteroids_9c2d41e6:

    # m "They say it's a way to get people to talk."
    m "他们说这也是让人开口说话的一种手段。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5739
translate chinese aineonsteroids_0f15250e:

    # mc "Not talking and not being able to explain are two different things!"
    mc "不愿意开口跟不知道怎么开口是不一样的！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5742
translate chinese aineonsteroids_db87b409:

    # mc "So... about you feeling uneasy when I'm not around. That could mean anything. But do you ever sense this unusual... connection when we're together?"
    mc "所以……你说我不在你身旁的时候，你会觉得不安。那可能有很多原因。但是你有没有感觉，我们之间……有一种不同寻常的联系？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5743
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2cdf8e68:

    # m "What kind of connection?"
    m "哪种联系？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5744
translate chinese aineonsteroids_bcfa3d97:

    # mc "Like I said, I don't know how to explain it. It's a feeling I've never had before."
    mc "我也说了，我不知道怎么解释。这种感觉我以前从来没有过。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5745
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5a783b66:

    # mc "Strange, but it's there. Do you feel it too?"
    mc "很奇怪，但的确存在。你能感觉到吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5746
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a580902d:

    # m "Because I grew up the way I did, my social development is lacking."
    m "因为我长大的环境与众不同，我对社会的认识非常有限。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5747
translate chinese aineonsteroids_afe51e7a:

    # m "It's only recently that I've been able to live my own life, thanks to you. So I have a lot of \"never felt this before\" moments. Can you elaborate?"
    m "多亏了你，我最近才能过上自己的生活。所以我有很多“以前从来没有过”的感觉。你能再说得详细点吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5750
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5e8ccb22:

    # mc "Okay, let me rephrase. How do you feel right now, at this moment?"
    mc "好吧，我换种说法。你现在，此时此刻，有什么感觉？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5751
translate chinese aineonsteroids_da822a70:

    # m "... Cold?"
    m "……冷？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5752
translate chinese aineonsteroids_68158721:

    # mc "No, not the temperature! Something deeper within, maybe?"
    mc "不，不是温度！是那种内心深处的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5755
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e612037c_1:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5758
translate chinese aineonsteroids_6e602bd0:

    # m "... Beyond that, I feel... grounded. And whole, somehow..."
    m "……除那之外，我觉得……脚踏实地。还有，很……完整……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5761
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e7282694:

    # yt "Still not what I'm looking for..."
    yt "依然不是我在找的感觉……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5766
translate chinese aineonsteroids_d8c81297:

    # mc "Now, tell me. What do you feel?"
    mc "现在呢？有什么感觉？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5767
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e612037c_2:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5770
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ab7d7e47:

    # m "I felt... a sudden jolt inside. But I don't know where, or... what it was..."
    m "我觉得……内心震颤了一下。但我不知道具体是在哪里，或者……到底是为什么……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5771
translate chinese aineonsteroids_0a873f4f:

    # m "It was weird."
    m "很奇怪。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5772
translate chinese aineonsteroids_3abd0fc8:

    # mc "Yes, that! I started to feel like that ever since we got closer to each other!"
    mc "对，就是这个！自从我们变亲近之后，我就开始有那种感觉了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5773
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a7be5672:

    # m "What was that...?"
    m "那是什么情况……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5774
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5868b1c4:

    # mc "That \"jolt\" thing? I don't have a clue."
    mc "那个“一震”吗？我不知道。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5775
translate chinese aineonsteroids_d4029fe0:

    # m "... Now that I'm aware, I felt the same thing when you talked to me on the sofa."
    m "……这下我反应过来了，你在沙发旁边跟我说话的时候，我也有一样的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5776
translate chinese aineonsteroids_00fe7084:

    # mc "Like, where? We've talked on a lot of sofas before."
    mc "哪里的沙发？我们在很多沙发上说过话啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5777
translate chinese aineonsteroids_d1f11a16:

    # m "Back in my headquarters. I felt you coming."
    m "在我的总部里。我感觉到了你会来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5778
translate chinese aineonsteroids_dbc8fb42:

    # mc "Huh...?! You felt me... coming?"
    mc "啊……？！你感觉到了……我会来？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5779
translate chinese aineonsteroids_1dbbfbd1:

    # m "Yeah."
    m "是啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5780
translate chinese aineonsteroids_63099ab6:

    # mc "What the hell..."
    mc "怎么可能……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5783
translate chinese aineonsteroids_37d163ac:

    # m "Y...your hand."
    m "你……你的手。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5784
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ecf2e1d3:

    # mc "Sorry, is it cold?"
    mc "抱歉，很凉吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5785
translate chinese aineonsteroids_24ed0cbf:

    # m "Yeah, a bit."
    m "是，有一点。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5792
translate chinese aineonsteroids_606a5b01:

    # m "*lightly gasps*"
    m "*轻轻吸气*"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5793
translate chinese aineonsteroids_d8c81297_1:

    # mc "Now, tell me. What do you feel?"
    mc "现在呢？有什么感觉？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5794
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e612037c_3:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5797
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ab7d7e47_1:

    # m "I felt... a sudden jolt inside. But I don't know where, or... what it was..."
    m "我觉得……内心震颤了一下。但我不知道具体是在哪里，或者……到底是为什么……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5798
translate chinese aineonsteroids_0a873f4f_1:

    # m "It was weird."
    m "很奇怪。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5799
translate chinese aineonsteroids_3abd0fc8_1:

    # mc "Yes, that! I started to feel like that ever since we got closer to each other!"
    mc "对，就是这个！自从我们变亲近之后，我就开始有那种感觉了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5800
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a7be5672_1:

    # m "What was that...?"
    m "那是什么情况……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5801
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a74da1f6:

    # mc "I wish I knew..."
    mc "我也想知道呢……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5802
translate chinese aineonsteroids_fc467b5e:

    # m "... Now that you mention it, I remember feeling something similar back when we talked on the sofa."
    m "……这下我反应过来了，你在沙发旁边跟我说话的时候，我也有一样的感觉。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5803
translate chinese aineonsteroids_9069cc67:

    # mc "Which sofa? We've talked on quite a few."
    mc "哪个沙发？我们在很多沙发上说过话啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5804
translate chinese aineonsteroids_060fd830:

    # m "In my headquarters. I sensed your presence before I even saw you."
    m "在我的总部里。我在看见你之前就感知到了你的存在。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5805
translate chinese aineonsteroids_66931baa:

    # mc "You sensed me... coming?"
    mc "你预感到……我会来？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5806
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ac3afacd:

    # m "Mhm."
    m "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5807
translate chinese aineonsteroids_63099ab6_1:

    # mc "What the hell..."
    mc "怎么可能……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5810
translate chinese aineonsteroids_b9e52059:

    # m "Uhm... y...your hand."
    m "呃……你……你的手。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5811
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ecf2e1d3_1:

    # mc "Sorry, is it cold?"
    mc "抱歉，很凉吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5812
translate chinese aineonsteroids_24ed0cbf_1:

    # m "Yeah, a bit."
    m "是，有一点。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5820
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a326f4cf:

    # mc "Don't worry, this is about as bad as it gets here. It never even snows."
    mc "没事，这里最多就到这种程度了。甚至从来没下过雪。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5821
translate chinese aineonsteroids_3c9341ba:

    # m "I hope it stays that way."
    m "我希望以后也不会下雪。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5824
translate chinese aineonsteroids_6cf17cb1:

    # mc "Hm? Why's that?"
    mc "嗯？为什么？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5825
translate chinese aineonsteroids_adc8d1dc:

    # m "In the military, snow has always been seen as a bad omen."
    m "在军队里，雪一直都是坏兆头。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5826
translate chinese aineonsteroids_f490a326:

    # m "They say when it snows, the pristine white reveals the true color of blood - a perfect reminder of life's fragility."
    m "他们说下雪之后，纯净的白色就会揭露出血真正的颜色——让人想起生命的脆弱。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5827
translate chinese aineonsteroids_9292c231:

    # m "Snow doesn't just blanket the ground; it unveils the hidden truths, often the painful ones."
    m "雪不仅会装饰大地；还会揭开隐藏的真相。通常来说，也是痛苦的真相。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5828
translate chinese aineonsteroids_f9d20c5b:

    # m "It's believed to foreshadow deaths, marking the world with a reminder of loss."
    m "大家觉得雪预示着死亡，会让这个世界回想起那些已经逝去的事物。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5829
translate chinese aineonsteroids_eb0b0e0f:

    # mc "That's a pretty intense perspective on snow."
    mc "这种对雪的看法很沉重啊。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5832
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2455e260:

    # m "Maybe it's an old belief, but it's always been a part of how I see the world."
    m "或许这是过时的看法了，但我一直都是这么想的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5833
translate chinese aineonsteroids_4a18dca5:

    # m "It reminds you that there's often more beneath the surface, even in something as beautiful as a snowfall beneath the moon..."
    m "雪会提醒你，表面之下往往会有深层的存在，哪怕是月光下美丽的落雪也是一样……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5836
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5839
translate chinese aineonsteroids_714dd2bb:

    # mc "It's interesting, how something as simple as weather can hold so much meaning."
    mc "很有意思，天气这样简单的东西居然也会有这么多讲究。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5840
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ac3afacd_1:

    # m "Mhm."
    m "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5843
translate chinese aineonsteroids_90c0cdc9:

    # mc "You know, Moon, I've always appreciated your perspective."
    mc "月，我一直很佩服你看事情的角度。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5844
translate chinese aineonsteroids_47f0c103:

    # mc "Yeah, you're an oddball, but you have these interesting things to tell."
    mc "你是个怪人，但你总能说出有意思的事来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5845
translate chinese aineonsteroids_089ec2ce:

    # mc "And... I've come to realize there's something between us. Something more than just a bodyguard and her charge."
    mc "而且……我已经意识到了我们之间有点不同寻常。不止是保镖和雇主。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5846
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a9ff73f0:

    # mc "Whatever it is, whatever we're feeling, I'm glad you're a part of my life."
    mc "不管那不寻常的关系到底是什么，不管我们的这种感觉到底是什么，我都很高兴你是我生命的一部分。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5849
translate chinese aineonsteroids_af0514ba:

    # m "And I promise you, commander, no matter what happens, I'll be there when you need me. Always. As long as I'm alive."
    m "我也向你保证，指挥官，不管发生什么，你需要我的时候，我都会出现。一直如此。只要我还活着。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5850
translate chinese aineonsteroids_232b3b9c:

    # mc "Well... to be honest, you don't have to try to accomplish anything special."
    mc "嗯……说实话，你不需要去完成什么特别的事。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5851
translate chinese aineonsteroids_f6ddb1f4:

    # mc "Even if no one likes you. Even if no one praises you... just being alive now is great enough."
    mc "哪怕没人喜欢你。哪怕没人表扬你……光是活着就足够伟大了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5852
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ae083b28:

    # mc "\"How nice is it getting to live another day?\". You can say it with a smile."
    mc "“能够活着迎接新的一天，这多好啊！”，只要能微笑着说出这句话……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5853
translate chinese aineonsteroids_7d5830e0:

    # mc "And that's enough, isn't it?"
    mc "那就足够了，对不对？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5854
translate chinese aineonsteroids_de9c3b09:

    # m "*chuckles* Thank you."
    m "*笑* 谢谢你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5857
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2784bac7:

    # mc "It's something my [landlord] used to tell me."
    mc "这是我[landlord!t]以前常对我说的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5858
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a62ea119:

    # mc "On the other hand, I want to achieve something. One thing I've been longing for ever since I met all of you."
    mc "但另一方面，我有想实现的一件事。这事自从我遇见你们以来就一直在想。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5859
translate chinese aineonsteroids_048b1302:

    # mc "I just want to live peacefully - together."
    mc "我只想和大家一起，平静地生活。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5860
translate chinese aineonsteroids_f03860ff:

    # mc "Someday, we'll never have to worry about anything. And I will make it happen."
    mc "总有一天，我们永远都不用再担心任何事了。我会让那一天到来的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5863
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a70eec1c:

    # m "At your disposal, Commander."
    m "随时听你命令，指挥官。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5864
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a737cfea:

    # mc "I'll count on you, Moon."
    mc "要多仰仗你了，月。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5865
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ffac71b4:

    # m "Of course. That's why I'm here."
    m "当然。所以我才会在这里。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5866
translate chinese aineonsteroids_f46b669d:

    # mc "*chuckles*"
    mc "*笑*"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5869
translate chinese aineonsteroids_67dbced6:

    # mc "Oh, by the way, is Freya still awake?"
    mc "哦，对了，芙蕾雅还醒着吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5870
translate chinese aineonsteroids_93f13701:

    # m "I doubt it. She seemed really beat when she got home."
    m "应该不会。她回家的时候似乎很累了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5873
translate chinese aineonsteroids_4d3df132:

    # mc "Ah, shoot! I completely forgot about that thing!"
    mc "啊，糟糕！有件事我给忘了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5882
translate chinese aineonsteroids_64f005b9:

    # mc "Frey...?"
    mc "芙蕾……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5883
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5885
translate chinese aineonsteroids_bd7c98f5:

    # mc "Freya, can we come in?"
    mc "芙蕾，我们可以进去吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5888
translate chinese aineonsteroids_917654e5:

    # m "Hey Freya, guess what? Your recent post just blew up online!"
    m "芙蕾雅，快看啊，你刚发的那条推特火了！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5889
translate chinese aineonsteroids_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5892
translate chinese aineonsteroids_9ae41603:

    # m "No reaction. She's definitely out like a light."
    m "没反应。她肯定睡得很熟。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5893
translate chinese aineonsteroids_d662873a:

    # mc "Huh...? What was that for?"
    mc "啊……？你刚刚说的话是什么意思？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5894
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ec874bb8:

    # m "She's usually obsessed with social media updates. I thought it might do the trick."
    m "她一般对社交媒体很在乎的。我想着说不定会有用。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5895
translate chinese aineonsteroids_4be68696:

    # m "Try the door. She's not one to lock it."
    m "试试直接开门吧。她不爱锁门的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5897
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5b2f9fb1:

    # yt "Oh yeah, we've learned that the hard way..."
    yt "是啊，我们为此学到了惨痛的教训……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5901
translate chinese aineonsteroids_648b3a3e:

    # mc "It's open."
    mc "没锁。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5902
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ac6606c4:

    # m "Leave your gift on her desk or by her bed. She'll see it when she wakes up."
    m "把你的礼物放到她的桌子上或者床边吧。她一醒过来就能看见了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5903
translate chinese aineonsteroids_9e2f705b:

    # mc "Good call."
    mc "好主意。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5910
translate chinese aineonsteroids_345d6885:

    # yt "Never fails to amaze me how you and your sister's sleeping positions are out of this world, Freya."
    yt "你跟你姐的睡姿真是让我大开眼界啊，芙蕾雅。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5913
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e7abd10a:

    # yt "Hope she likes it, whatever Hera bought for her."
    yt "不管赫拉给她买了什么，都希望她能喜欢。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5917
translate chinese aineonsteroids_81deb3c6:

    # m "All set?"
    m "搞定了？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5918
translate chinese aineonsteroids_26a3b790:

    # mc "Yeah, gift's delivered."
    mc "嗯，礼物送到了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5921
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ca76dfb2:

    # mc "Hey, I'm pretty beat. I think I'm gonna hit the hay as well."
    mc "啊，我累坏了。我也早点上床吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5922
translate chinese aineonsteroids_18969e77:

    # m "Alright. Sleep well, [mc]."
    m "好的。睡个好觉，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5923
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5bcf8be3:

    # mc "You too, Moon. Good night."
    mc "你也是，月。晚安。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5934
translate chinese aineonsteroids_fe4a2fa7:

    # mc "Was that entrance necessary?"
    mc "有必要还耍个帅吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5935
translate chinese aineonsteroids_64a24b97:

    # m "Yes. Those other times don't count. This is my first real kiss with you."
    m "有必要。其他几次不算数。这次是我第一次真正亲你。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5936
translate chinese aineonsteroids_b71f24ed:

    # m "I wanted to be the one to initiate my first kiss. Then maybe, next time, I want you to take the rest from me."
    m "我想主动送出我的初吻。然后，下一次，说不定，我就想让你主动做其他事了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5937
translate chinese aineonsteroids_080806e7:

    # mc "Oof... You're really tempting me now."
    mc "哈哈……你这下诱惑住我了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5938
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5d265174:

    # m "Have a good one, Commander."
    m "睡个好觉，指挥官。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5939
translate chinese aineonsteroids_8efc2aba:

    # mc "*chuckles* You too, Moon. Sleep well."
    mc "*笑* 你也是，月。睡个好觉。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5944
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5947
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5c090e89:

    # mc "...."
    mc "…………"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5950
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e5af8d29:

    # mc "To who we'll be in the future: May we meet with grace the scars of our past, and let the memories of today guide us towards a world we dream of."
    mc "至未来的我们：愿我们从容面对过去的伤痕，让今天的记忆引领我们走向梦想中的世界吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6010
translate chinese aineonsteroids_9061660c:

    # h "Please, Jess..."
    h "拜托，婕斯……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6011
translate chinese aineonsteroids_eea787ce:

    # h "I know I've made mistakes. Please, I'm begging you..."
    h "我知道我犯了错。拜托，我求你了……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6012
translate chinese aineonsteroids_210aa3a7:

    # h "Look after my daughters for me...!"
    h "替我照顾好我的两个女儿吧……！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6013
translate chinese aineonsteroids_b4fa3fc0:

    # j "..."
    j "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6017
translate chinese aineonsteroids_7e51bb67:

    # j "It's hard to see you this way. So broken, so desperate. But I can't do what you're asking."
    j "看到你这样真是难受。这么痛苦，这么绝望。可是我没法满足你的要求。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6018
translate chinese aineonsteroids_0fed3f1b:

    # j "I warned you once, but you ignored me. You've lost my sympathy."
    j "我警告过你，你却无视了我。你已经失去了我的同情。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6019
translate chinese aineonsteroids_e7805548:

    # j "However, there's one thing I need from you."
    j "但是，我需要你做到一件事。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6022
translate chinese aineonsteroids_45955103:

    # h "Anything, please tell me!"
    h "什么都可以，告诉我吧！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6025
translate chinese aineonsteroids_f5709cd6:

    # j "Abandon your dreams and face the end. Let it all go-"
    j "放弃你的梦想，面对结局吧。放下一切——"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6028
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5ed99f63:

    # mc "-Perhaps then, someone might brave the world you've created out of selfishness."
    mc "——或许到那时，就可能有人勇敢地面对你出于自私而创造的世界。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6029
translate chinese aineonsteroids_99094f6a:

    # mc "Tell her that."
    mc "就这么告诉她。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6032
translate chinese aineonsteroids_3e2b5d29:

    # j "*chuckles softly*"
    j "*轻笑*"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6033
translate chinese aineonsteroids_870a4a71:

    # cl "It's almost like I'm seeing a part of you in him lately."
    cl "我最近几乎都要在他身上看到你的影子了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6036
translate chinese aineonsteroids_dcb0f697:

    # j "I suppose he does carry some of my influence. After all, he asked me to deliver the same message I told her when picked up that gift."
    j "我想他的确受了我的一些影响。毕竟，他在收下那份礼物的时候让我传达的消息，跟我告诉她的话一模一样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6037
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ce8dd876:

    # cl "He's become your most intriguing creation, I suppose."
    cl "他已经成为你最有趣的创造了。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6040
translate chinese aineonsteroids_55b83f51:

    # j "Hm, I'm not sure about that. My only desire is to see him thrive, with or without my influence."
    j "嗯，这可不好说。不管有没有我的影响，我只想让他好好活着。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6041
translate chinese aineonsteroids_027748e6:

    # j "Ultimately, it's his life, his choices."
    j "说到底，这是他的生活，他的选择。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6044
translate chinese aineonsteroids_5e77c0c0:

    # cl "..."
    cl "……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6045
translate chinese aineonsteroids_b12403c7:

    # j "You seem troubled. There is no point if you're going to stay silent."
    j "你好像有心事。憋着不说可不会解决问题。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6048
translate chinese aineonsteroids_1a0bd273:

    # cl "... This might sound strange, but I need to say it."
    cl "……听起来可能有点奇怪，但我必须说出来。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6049
translate chinese aineonsteroids_0d43636e:

    # j "Go on."
    j "说吧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6050
translate chinese aineonsteroids_7e7b6770:

    # cl "Ever since I first met [mc], there's been this unsettling feeling. It intensifies every time we lock eyes."
    cl "自从我第一次遇见[mc!t]，就一直有一种不安的感觉。每一次我们目光相对，这种感觉就会加剧。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6051
translate chinese aineonsteroids_688248e5:

    # cl "I think Fang sensed it too, at some point. Maybe even far worse, or better...?"
    cl "我想獠牙也感受到了。或许她的情况更糟糕……或者更好……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6054
translate chinese aineonsteroids_b0dc4f52:

    # j "Huh? It's not like you to talk nonsense."
    j "啊？说胡话可不像你会做的事。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6055
translate chinese aineonsteroids_325ab507:

    # cl "How do I put this... It's sort of... a nagging sense of..."
    cl "我该怎么说呢……这是一种……一种纠缠不休的……"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6056
translate chinese aineonsteroids_50440848:

    # cl "Familiarity, perhaps?"
    cl "亲近感吧，大概？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6059
translate chinese aineonsteroids_9d54c465:

    # j "!!!"
    j "！！！"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6062
translate chinese aineonsteroids_1a54448a:

    # cl "Are you sure this is a battle he should be fighting?"
    cl "你确定这是他该参加的战斗吗？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6063
translate chinese aineonsteroids_262350fc:

    # cl "The boy merely wants something simple, but he keeps ending up in these needless fights."
    cl "那个男孩只想过简单的生活，最后却总被卷入这些不必要的纷争里。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6066
translate chinese aineonsteroids_b26b785c:

    # j "Call him, now."
    j "给他打电话，快。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6067
translate chinese aineonsteroids_610d7e7c:

    # cl "Him, or...?"
    cl "是他，还是……？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6068
translate chinese aineonsteroids_12083012:

    # j "Yes, I want to see Aveline's twin once more. I need some answers."
    j "对，我要再见一次艾芙琳的哥哥。我需要答案。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6076
translate chinese aineonsteroids_44266eba:

    # jov "This is Jovian. Entry for April 12th, XXXX. It's [mc]'s second day in the hospital."
    jov "我是乔维安。XXXX年4月12日。今天是[mc!t]住院的第二天。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6079
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ec854389:

    # jov "The doctors... they've confirmed it. [mc], my little boy, just three years old, he's got a terminal brain tumor."
    jov "医生们……已经确认了。[mc!t]，可怜的孩子，才三岁，就得了晚期的脑肿瘤。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6080
translate chinese aineonsteroids_b8bbbd67:

    # jov "I couldn't... I couldn't just sit there and do nothing. So, I sought out Bonheur, a trusted friend, a brilliant mind, once known as a leading scientist."
    jov "我没法……我没法什么也不做。所以，我去找了博纳尔，一个我信得过的朋友，他很聪明，以前是很出名的科学家。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6083
translate chinese aineonsteroids_ea6e60aa:

    # jov "I pleaded with him, desperate for any cure, anything that could save [mc] from his cruel fate."
    jov "我跟他求了情，让他想想办法，只要能救[mc!t]，怎么样都可以。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6086
translate chinese aineonsteroids_d5d8d933:

    # jov "And Bonheur... had something. A miracle drug, he called it. Claimed it could cure any illness."
    jov "而博纳尔……真的有办法。他有一种奇迹之药。说是包治百病。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6087
translate chinese aineonsteroids_544fb8f9:

    # jov "But the cost... is being in debt to him, possibly for the rest of my life."
    jov "但是代价……大概就是我的余生都要亏欠他。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6088
translate chinese aineonsteroids_70dec081:

    # jov "But what is debt compared to [mc]'s life? I didn't hesitate, not for a second. I accepted it, all for [mc], to save him."
    jov "可是人情债跟[mc!t]的命比起来算什么？我一秒钟都没有犹豫。我接受了，一切都是为了救[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6091
translate chinese aineonsteroids_462952bf:

    # jov "This... this right here... is called the {i}\"Chimera Genesis Serum\"{/i}."
    jov "这个东西……这个瓶子里面……装的就是{i}“嵌合体创生血清”{/i}。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6092
translate chinese aineonsteroids_4ee06837:

    # jov "It seems this serum is... the future of warfare between the Glabia and Sha Crea territories."
    jov "似乎这个血清……将来会被用在格拉比亚和沙克雷亚的战争里。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6093
translate chinese aineonsteroids_7c59fa65:

    # jov "In their longstanding conflict, Glabia plans to use it as a covert weapon."
    jov "冲突已经持续了很久，格拉比亚把这东西当做是反败为胜的武器。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6096
translate chinese aineonsteroids_0d165a57:

    # jov "There, it's known by a rather cryptic name:"
    jov "在那里，这东西有一个让人摸不到头脑的名字："

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6097
translate chinese aineonsteroids_1ea067cd:

    # jov "... The {i}\"Numbers Serum\"{/i}." with Dissolve(2.0)
    jov "……{i}“编号血清”{/i}。" with Dissolve(2.0)

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6100
translate chinese aineonsteroids_2da110d7:

    # m "All the others were always created in pairs, like One and Two. My friends, Five and Six, then Seven and Eight."
    m "其他人，比如一号和二号，都是被成对创造出来的。我的朋友，五号和六号，七号和八号，都是一样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6101
translate chinese aineonsteroids_b312a451:

    # m "It always made me wonder... why was I the only one created alone? Why just me?"
    m "我一直在想……为什么我是唯一一个被单独创造出来的？为什么只有我？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6102
translate chinese aineonsteroids_9c4d9bfa:

    # m "[mc]...you're...how..."
    m "[mc!t]……你……怎么会……"

