# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5559
translate chinese aineonsteroids_1d73d106:

    # mc "So, is it safe to say I can stay here tonight?"
    mc "看来今晚我可以在这睡下了吧？"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:5851
translate chinese aineonsteroids_52c2ea7d:

    # mc "It's something Jovian used to tell me."
    mc "这是乔维安以前常对我说的。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6030
translate chinese aineonsteroids_23fe7437:

    # j "I suppose he does carry some of my influence. After all, he asked me to deliver the same message I told her when I picked up that gift."
    j "我想他的确受了我的一些影响。毕竟，他在收下那份礼物的时候让我传达的消息，跟我告诉她的话一模一样。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6082
translate chinese aineonsteroids_4d282e7b:

    # jov "But what is debt compared to [mc]'s life? Even if he's not my blood, it doesn't matter. I love him like my own son."
    jov "可是人情债跟[mc!t]的命比起来算什么？尽管他不是我的骨肉，也无所谓。我把他当作我的亲生儿子一样疼爱。"

# game/ch1ep3p2.rpy:6083
translate chinese aineonsteroids_69c98f07:

    # jov "I didn't hesitate, not for a second. I accepted it, all for [mc], to save him."
    jov "我一秒钟都没有犹豫。我接受了，一切都是为了救[mc!t]。"

